    <node id="Union Harmonisation Legislation">
      <data key="d0">Union Harmonisation Legislation</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Union Harmonisation Legislation is a comprehensive set of laws and regulations established by the European Union (EU) aimed at achieving uniformity in regulations across Member States. This body of legislation is specifically designed to ensure consistent standards and safety for various products and services, with a particular focus on high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems. By providing a cohesive legal framework, Union Harmonisation Legislation facilitates regulatory integration and compliance, promoting adherence to established guidelines among member countries.

The legislation outlines safety and performance standards that products, particularly those related to high-risk AI systems, must meet. This ensures that these systems are effectively regulated and overseen, thereby fostering a safe and compliant environment for technology deployment throughout the EU. Additionally, Union Harmonisation Legislation establishes a regulatory framework for product safety, ensuring that products within the EU meet specific requirements and standards to facilitate free movement across Member States. Overall, the legislation aims to promote regulatory consistency while enhancing the safety and compliance of products and systems across the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Union harmonisation legislation consists of laws and regulations established by the EU to ensure consistency in standards and compliance across Member States.&lt;SEP&gt;Union harmonisation legislation comprises regulatory frameworks established by the European Union to ensure standardization and safety compliance across various products.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-dda722630e3447daa9258a423b2cbedd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9cac9d5c84dcacd663b50bbd6c7786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2fe126564dfd9a342c90d435dae0173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3adfd2c3d24b0ffaaec321d3b79c3f39&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfbc57f477c4bd1902758e6902584d19&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-492be2be76ac28fb634286d651691400&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-031fbe0de70cf6f462d8e21fea6487e6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e36887a71116638e4cc965ab67bef7ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-13251cb96e29c95cab559ac75d5b1f1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1bca7fe15bcbe076f97f98b2f3479775&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-816f53d15728655866c48a3917b944f0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4f3473e38ccd9ad84662b373166a5c2b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bff2cb7a8bc7b162d1d512fa7d0a60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-95c78946b57af53cc3de27b286cf36eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c89fbb177b0adfb819460dd999b9788d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-474278e863b3ff46a7c4578eb30850a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9512f56ddf79fc1a7f65b696c84e2eb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02b30ca877df5f1c4eaed18ba9fb4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63123bed96791237f23a210dcf270306</data>
