    <node id="AI System">
      <data key="d0">AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">AI Systems refer to a broad category of advanced automated technologies designed to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as understanding natural language, recognizing images, and making decisions. These systems are characterized by their capabilities for learning, reasoning, and inferring outputs from data, allowing them to operate autonomously across various applications, including manipulation of images, audio, and video. They can create deep fakes that may closely resemble real persons or events.

AI Systems are utilized across various domains including civilian, humanitarian, law enforcement, and military applications. Due to their significant potential impacts on health, safety, and fundamental rights, AI Systems are classified into high-risk and non-high-risk categories according to European Union and national laws. High-risk AI Systems, which pose greater risks, are subject to stringent governance centered on principles of privacy, transparency, diversity, and fairness. Compliance with these principles ensures adherence to regulatory standards, and high-risk AI Systems must meet specific maintenance requirements while also complying with legal frameworks that govern their diverse functionalities and associated risks.

The technological framework of AI Systems involves a continuous learning and adaptation process. This necessitates compliance assessments whenever there are changes to either their functioning or intended purpose. Overall, AI Systems represent complex technological structures that process information and perform a wide range of tasks. They carry obligations regarding their intended and precluded uses and are subject to testing and evaluation by providers, emphasizing their predictability, reversibility, and the legal obligations surrounding their operations. As governed by principles of data protection and privacy, AI Systems must adhere to specific regulations and standards to ensure responsible and ethical use.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI system refers to a collection of algorithms and models designed to perform tasks that typically require human intelligence, such as data processing, content generation, and decision-making.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI system is a technological entity that is subject to regulations concerning market compliance and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI system is a technological solution intended to augment or improve human activities, often in relation to high-risk uses as specified in regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;An AI system categorized as high-risk pertains to its safety and compliance with specific regulations but does not ensure that the product itself is deemed high-risk.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-63123bed96791237f23a210dcf270306&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-18590180ace1a86abda373a524de5d70&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89272eea67d32d6ca0a58d004c2f75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-294c88b41db00dcd8f4482345b658105&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c1630fe82dedd2af2d49f1b480b55eec&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9cac9d5c84dcacd663b50bbd6c7786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2fe126564dfd9a342c90d435dae0173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3af424118c8f8024a835a3de370430b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de448579f0f397ec535d8acdb68580bc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043dd859ed68e9fbb76ff618fe32c054&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17d875a9ff2b02237bb4b9ba04e5b92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e010ebb9b0353d97d9e67673267bc415&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d2c99da125b1a260d6205d5ccdcda33d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c99635d8be9520a61f07475e6f38b608&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfc478de6f2db42158f4375b3746b2a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698242b390a097d688dcef4fc03d6687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f20adf0cd08ecffde7f6a9e3860025d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb293bcc156cb87ef4a7db6744a38f0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a7fb5abd6ad1ba2e9256fc63dbda4a7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-22fe2322637df933b39b478cbc8c7a08&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-414a5bbdb827f9d405cd31cc218f4ee9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-343138c98bcd39f893aee610a717cfc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5b5f473c726cccbd493c4eb35ca6cec8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79847bb42790114b4e3db575c6fe603a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f47aa930b4d23e13586827fdcfea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-85726b1098cb96ad81df40234ad5da52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d21ee76ebe03dd794f42225c64861fb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e36887a71116638e4cc965ab67bef7ba&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-219c0f42877791608631c01683c4dad5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93a291f34d113ade59ae8d1ab3a9e32a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b4365b37f348c4492d16b0258db2b4a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-550dce9dde15c8e156ca0acc92343929&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09f7f5e50e0159a18231b3da95f30cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7a97b6144d96bce021cd4b80f21b84&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5ebb00fdd14767c86b1a8c766db05a7c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e60a602cb4413f08687b677f68eb970c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f950b0056f6fe5d8f4c1fed6ffcce00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a9e7815086e5c37a3beb2705ee18d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed721d84482f8eb2ef2f8c288d59095&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1b88de119a362d1ff7d1500b9782d0c6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6adccf24f1ddc4835908b879bcbe8674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad430846dc3448ba37c9f18d213e761</data>
