    <node id="Product Manufacturer">
      <data key="d0">Product Manufacturer</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">A Product Manufacturer is an entity that creates products which may include high-risk AI systems as components, governed by specific regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Product manufacturers are entities responsible for ensuring that their products, including embedded AI systems, comply with relevant regulations before they can be marketed or put into service.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f2fe126564dfd9a342c90d435dae0173&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63123bed96791237f23a210dcf270306</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/25/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/87/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748427602</data>
    </node>
    <node id="High-Risk AI System">
      <data key="d0">High-Risk AI System</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">A high-risk AI system refers to artificial intelligence technologies that pose significant risks to health, safety, or fundamental rights when used according to their intended purpose or in foreseeable misuse scenarios.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are defined as advanced artificial intelligence technologies that pose significant risks to safety, ethics, and fundamental rights. Due to their potential impact, these systems are subject to stringent regulations and standards, particularly within the framework established by the European Union (EU). Before entering the market, High-Risk AI Systems must comply with specific documentation and compliance requirements, which include meticulous oversight designed to mitigate adverse effects on individual rights and public safety.

These AI systems must adhere to defined technical and performance parameters, emphasizing safety and effectiveness standards. They are classified based on their ability to produce legal effects or substantially influence individuals, which mandates a high degree of transparency in their usage. Providers of High-Risk AI Systems are obligated to follow regulatory frameworks that enforce legal certainty and compliance, reflecting the significance of their impact on safety and ethics.

Additionally, the application of High-Risk AI Systems raises concerns regarding individual rights and freedoms, particularly in workplace environments, necessitating strict adherence to compliance protocols. Rigorous post-market monitoring is essential to ensure the safe operation of these systems, highlighting the need for continuous assessment following their deployment. In summary, High-Risk AI Systems require careful scrutiny and established reporting obligations to effectively address their potential risks, ensuring they remain accessible and aligned with comprehensive safety and compliance standards.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f9ecbbe19a0b82c0cc27910d673dea46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed64bdb2c36cf3a65859258e7888a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2207c69786b5e6add33d2fe8c768a341&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f51d60adf9ebc465ed7e51912ec15382&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6c66d3fba6e6dadb3426f70cb98376c1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9cac9d5c84dcacd663b50bbd6c7786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cacea1a9e8134dea64495d76d382dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-047db7dca163c57bf9683404937e7ec5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b453ab3d6dba9c33ee17222e5c44491b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bb293bcc156cb87ef4a7db6744a38f0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba1dc3004941b91546fa83dccd4be34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad430846dc3448ba37c9f18d213e761&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-87ab257ee4df19878199b525e3ae854e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b15dea67a3df634ebeaeb58168eda214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e428719939f639dff07b7393c2795962&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-684d5ab49c1881859fc01c26e46049cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9715a176fe159c930bda821593bb9bee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-933ead385d4e52b665df0118cb006cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c9bff2cb7a8bc7b162d1d512fa7d0a60&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-43fe7b5e70d3f0ef6fef527c8f0773f7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c74c72b39d6d10e4a07d1cd427ae52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c0a6eb47abd8e339b7c043651460a0bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-858c2a77ba4972f9c4e3f47479bfef07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-474278e863b3ff46a7c4578eb30850a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58f0e847b8539a8464411c02db611351&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02b30ca877df5f1c4eaed18ba9fb4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-63123bed96791237f23a210dcf270306</data>
