ligenceact.eu/article/2/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/106/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/170/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/77/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/47/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/50/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/64/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/156/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/1/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/8/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/61/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/88/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/89/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/27/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/100/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/66/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/149/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/46/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/25/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/25/</data>
