ligenceact.eu/recital/175/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/60/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/20/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/148/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/2/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/65/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/168/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/76/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/95/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/151/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/77/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/64/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/156/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/9/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/46/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/80/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/88/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/138/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/40/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/179/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/30/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/66/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/3/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/149/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/126/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/24/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/144/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/131/</data>
