alintelligenceact.eu/recital/57/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/1/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/3/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/17/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/44/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/44/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/68/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/132/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/20/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/34/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/74/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/79/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/63/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/88/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/82/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/71/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/77/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/75/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/70/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/125/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/57/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/40/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/94/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/7/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/56/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/29/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/61/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/50/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/156/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/8/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/9/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/30/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/24/</data>
