    <node id="Directive (EU) 2016/2102">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2016/2102</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2016/2102 establishes accessibility requirements that high-risk AI systems must comply with.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/2102 includes accessibility requirements that must be complied with by high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/2102 is a European legislative measure that mandates accessibility for the websites and mobile applications of public sector bodies.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b15dea67a3df634ebeaeb58168eda214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a25b8d2308a532accd5bf77027c9a7df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ca70346de523ce75c24d3a1979714d</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/16/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/80/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748426023</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Directive (EU) 2019/882">
      <data key="d0">Directive (EU) 2019/882</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2019/882 focuses on the accessibility of products and services in the EU, which impacts the usability of the EU database.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/882 is a legislative framework established by the European Parliament and Council that focuses on the accessibility requirements for products and services within the European Union. This directive aims to ensure inclusivity for persons with disabilities in technology development, emphasizing the importance of making products and services accessible to all individuals. Furthermore, Directive (EU) 2019/882 establishes specific accessibility requirements related to high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems, outlining further compliance requirements for these technologies. Overall, the directive addresses the impacts of AI systems on individuals' autonomy and decision-making, promoting responsible and inclusive advancements in technology.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2019/882 sets out requirements for ensuring accessibility to information in the EU database, aimed at enhancing public availability and use.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b15dea67a3df634ebeaeb58168eda214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58064eb84a11a467b8fc7fc22d8c7b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65b8417f540a870b55b1e60c66cd42e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a25b8d2308a532accd5bf77027c9a7df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-21a89ce17cf59281aee293dc5db92f0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-53ca70346de523ce75c24d3a1979714d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5d38e2dee253890587ca2dd6a1e4e0b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c050fb13af07ed12982fe6bfe7abf4</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/16/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/80/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/29/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/131/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748427002</data>
    </node>
    <node id="United Nations">
      <data key="d0">United Nations</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The United Nations is an international organization founded in 1945, which works on various global issues, including human rights, social justice, and development.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b15dea67a3df634ebeaeb58168eda214</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/80/</data>
