    <node id="Persons with Disabilities">
      <data key="d0">Persons with Disabilities</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Persons with Disabilities are individuals who face barriers in accessing opportunities and resources, and for whom AI-based solutions aim to improve accessibility.&lt;SEP&gt;Persons with disabilities refer to individuals who have physical, mental, intellectual, or sensory impairments that may hinder their full and effective participation in society.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-b15dea67a3df634ebeaeb58168eda214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-813ac9e32b54acc82ef6b73432a7cd7a</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/80/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/142/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748427142</data>
    </node>
    <node id="European Parliament">
      <data key="d0">European Parliament</data>
      <data key="d1">organization</data>
      <data key="d2">The European Parliament is a legislative body of the European Union, involved in creating laws and directives, including those related to measuring instruments.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is a vital legislative body of the European Union (EU), serving as a representative institution for the citizens of its member states. Composed of directly elected Members of Parliament, it plays a crucial role in the governance and legislative processes of the EU. Engaging in thorough debate and decision-making, the Parliament addresses a wide array of issues, including cybersecurity, artificial intelligence (AI), data governance, trade secrets, the rights of persons with disabilities, and matters related to migration and asylum.

Tasked with the crucial responsibility of drafting, approving, and enacting laws and regulations, the European Parliament collaborates closely with the Council of the European Union. It actively evaluates reports from the European Commission on significant topics such as copyright, product safety, and standards governing high-risk AI systems. Recent legislative endeavors include the adoption of Regulation (EU) 2022/2065, which focuses on major regulatory areas, and Regulation (EU) 2024/900, which targets political advertising. 

Furthermore, the European Parliament is instrumental in overseeing and approving delegated acts, thereby contributing to the overarching legislative framework of the EU. Through its enactment of directives and regulations, it shapes important policies that significantly impact the lives of EU citizens across various sectors, including employment, working conditions, collective labor rights, aviation, and transportation.

In summary, the European Parliament is central to the development, amendment, and approval of legislation while ensuring democratic accountability. Its role extends to addressing ethical considerations surrounding emerging technologies like AI and robotics, cementing its position as a key institution in influencing the regulatory landscape of the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is one of the two legislative bodies within the European Union, involved in the process of making EU laws and policy decisions.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is the legislative body of the European Union, involved in adopting and amending regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is the legislative body of the European Union, involved in the formulation and adoption of regulations such as Regulation (EU) 2019/2144.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-95e4a754288e197556a2ac28696f415d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-654b17e6ab435ca442e9075545af0c79&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3accdffb1c2e32b663cc603e80d7c590&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eef924ac2e26af24531952fcd79e9d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5bfe284b31053ed0488ca88518b58ac1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f49bab3ffe15bdb9d4d12f5b8ce62182&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f32100de89356334a47cd2317dde09df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-06455acfb04ed0ea0e1fcd7b8fa89595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756d4785a21d555261254273b91aea54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-72f817acfaca14a17a21a75176f408a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-57118cd489d78b33ed75c63f33151aee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99768c8a9d9e625e95c97ba673449e27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-30b3beca6b2129e6e4eb44988d1de112&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6ae59e0a0d71d982ef900a9cf17ed916&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-96fc50a27ad634f25ca804994bf54408&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204417a83231993542d757c6207e53bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79b7078e45aa680595b27c1baab1b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-07fb722dbde5159480cfd0e4534fc632&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cf0d6bb3a9bb4e12605c032254429e91&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e9d6472f6799d71df39a63934dcde4f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ab052c1ea237cce80eb265d1e45d48c7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb86d6b70eaa122acc5132e883f67477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a2bf8c519aff48aa30866bbefc0dc688&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-19fe8af9bab5bc955f3f1bb6e0c9c017&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02c1809d1e7a16e9c8b3d0effff3a40&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c6f966dd054aee06b6959f9cca80bffc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79114aa8214caf01a991b9fd731ca2f1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b15dea67a3df634ebeaeb58168eda214&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-895d6dbeb694bb42f8956b66c8927bc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58064eb84a11a467b8fc7fc22d8c7b0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceb3dc76830ec642fabf4620edacf57&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2633a0fb5f0222ac492dc16170f8b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7159c0fe88b88c3a3080fefad7a98419&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d8ace04fdc35c72669aa7d3ef95d6460&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f916ea8f111ac8a27b80c713b9819522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-912c6c18744e587fbf617952631e25a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93e6a954a9283acf571ff61858a432ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1219d54497e2a4a6af07e6b10274bc72&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0d4324ec2284f40e56458ffbe5d2da80&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-684d5ab49c1881859fc01c26e46049cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b8079d3300c15