      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/172/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/78/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/92/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/103/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/108/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/141/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/78/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/74/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/60/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/80/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/107/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/110/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/173/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/10/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/174/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/97/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/104/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/77/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/49/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/106/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/33/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/158/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/62/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/105/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/112/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/175/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/109/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/29/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/8/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/166/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/9/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/11/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/121/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificia