    <node id="Accessibility Requirements">
      <data key="d0">Accessibility Requirements</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Accessibility requirements are legal mandates ensuring that high-risk AI systems are usable by individuals with disabilities, as outlined in specific directives.&lt;SEP&gt;Accessibility requirements refer to the legal standards and guidelines that ensure technologies and services are usable by persons with disabilities.</data>
