    <node id="mutatis mutandis">
      <data key="d0">mutatis mutandis</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Mutatis mutandis is a Latin phrase used in legal and academic texts to indicate that adjustments must be made to account for differences in specific situations while retaining the same principles.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f116bf22239caa9434d2435cf37794bb</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/161/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748426044</data>
    </node>
    <node id="2019/1020">
      <data key="d0">2019/1020</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">2019/1020 refers to a specific time period or event, typically used in legal contexts.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f116bf22239caa9434d2435cf37794bb</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/161/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748426044</data>
    </node>
    <node id="General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d0">General-Purpose AI Models</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">General-Purpose AI Models are a category of artificial intelligence systems specifically designed to perform a wide array of tasks across diverse applications and industries. Unlike specialized AI systems that focus on singular tasks, these models utilize various types of training data and employ multiple learning methodologies, enhancing their versatility and broad applicability. They are central to discussions regarding codes of practice for managing systemic risks associated with AI technologies.

The development and deployment of General-Purpose AI Models necessitate adherence to specific regulatory frameworks, particularly within the European Union, where compliance and risk management are critical. These models must undergo thorough evaluations for potential risks, with assessments conducted by panels that classify their capabilities and ensure regulatory compliance. This careful scrutiny helps mitigate associated risks, as these systems can impact multiple domains.

Moreover, General-Purpose AI Models can also be made available under open-source licenses, facilitating broader access and fostering innovation. However, their extensive applicability underscores the need for standardization, especially regarding energy-efficient development practices. While they offer numerous benefits, these models present systemic risks that require careful regulation and oversight for responsible use and deployment.

Compliance with regulations is particularly crucial for models that are placed on the market before August 2025, which will involve continuous monitoring and enforcement of established rules to ensure their safety and effectiveness. Overall, General-Purpose AI Models represent a significant advancement in AI technology, emphasizing the importance of regulatory adherence for their responsible deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models are versatile artificial intelligence systems used as foundations for various downstream applications and services.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-bfd9734e617f6b77f1d098f074a31788&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4650c5b3d73643d93f915f7eeb206da5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ae5c70e1b98b5f33eb047bb55022e9d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad9133b1b75e03ab5dc35d035927dbb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756bc5b856a1d06a78ffd0aeb1d318b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-408ee65c3eab1e86c1c4207deaf4f216&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46a2185c0e7d022c2e0146a9f59929c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-366448bb58f05fbe95d08e2bec3f1b28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e7bb3413d9de075f3d726ec4825bbdf1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f2f1f6979dcac05f71b03e16c6362efe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-831c946b1acae90a683cbc5ac489ffaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3d709837f2bf640b25f168a3359606f3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2e327abeb2deab3469d3ca5e1cbc290e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5923815c3c9119488dbfaacede6dec0c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-608fa30e901d53cfe8a70a06d1760b00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de9b8f7d9312e3a2994cf6e1b14f1f9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-be11332f2ca4895c0b3e1f0560018e61&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-912c6c18744e587fbf617952631e25a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-898711e7e6ddb7ddaceadb36ff94f179&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3f3abbad4dddf2a8a56efeaa03cc7f28&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9e7bb7f2671f4090f24b5396183a3f1e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f567c4be37bce779f921de15ad5f2a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f93754b5b045f375c5040d0de011e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-135955417d9c4f07fe24d56cf4e32c04&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c8209179d5378dd2b308defab64f33b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3b0c7969cb66b898e1cf29a29c2c3923&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa0ab303aa0764433ae306cd3e410cb</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/111/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/54/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/117/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/101/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/68/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/162/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/55/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/101/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/104/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/41/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/164/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/115/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/89/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/112/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/40/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/107/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/106/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/116/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/109/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/97/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/114/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/89/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/179/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/66/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/53/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748428620</data>
