    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2022/868">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2022/868</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2022/868 addresses European data governance and amends previous laws related to data governance.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2022/868 pertains to European data governance, impacting how AI systems are tested and data is managed across the EU.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06455acfb04ed0ea0e1fcd7b8fa89595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd4e3bfdc01d686ffb1a660c85e1d7e9</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/141/</data>
      <data key="d5">1748426696</data>
    </node>
    <node id="Regulation (EU) 2023/2854">
      <data key="d0">Regulation (EU) 2023/2854</data>
      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 establishes harmonised rules for fair access to and use of data, impacting data management practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 is another legislative document related to governance and the handling of data within the EU context.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2023/2854 pertains to harmonised rules on fair access to and use of data, amending previous regulations and directives.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-06455acfb04ed0ea0e1fcd7b8fa89595&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eb86d6b70eaa122acc5132e883f67477&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fd4e3bfdc01d686ffb1a660c85e1d7e9</data>
