      <data key="d0">Directive 2008/48/EC</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2008/48/EC focuses on credit agreements for consumers, aiming to promote transparency and consumer protection in the lending process.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2008/48/EC regulates consumer credit agreements in the EU, ensuring transparency and fairness for consumers.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f916ea8f111ac8a27b80c713b9819522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceb3dc76830ec642fabf4620edacf57</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/158/</data>
