      <data key="d0">Directive 2009/138/EC</data>
      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2009/138/EC establishes regulatory measures for insurance companies within the EU, focusing on solvency and policyholder protection.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2009/138/EC governs the business of insurance and re-insurance, known as Solvency II to ensure stability in the insurance sector.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2009/138/EC pertains to the prudential supervision of insurance and re-insurance undertakings.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-f916ea8f111ac8a27b80c713b9819522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5feee5d6760dd9294ff28632c1064eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceb3dc76830ec642fabf4620edacf57</data>
