      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive 2014/17/EU focuses on credit agreements for consumers related to residential immovable property in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2014/17/EU governs the regulation of consumer credit related to residential property, focusing on consumer protection in lending practices.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive 2014/17/EU relates to credit agreements for consumers concerning residential properties and aims at improving consumer protection in the housing sector.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-822d11ee35b843c977677acb37cb5e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f916ea8f111ac8a27b80c713b9819522&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7ceb3dc76830ec642fabf4620edacf57</data>
