      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">The Single Supervisory Mechanism is a system for banking supervision in the Eurozone, enabling the European Central Bank to oversee financial institutions.&lt;SEP&gt;The Single Supervisory Mechanism is a system that ensures effective oversight of banks within the Eurozone.</data>
