      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">Council Regulation (EU) No 1024/2013 defines the specific tasks of the European Central Bank regarding credit institutions' supervision.&lt;SEP&gt;Council Regulation (EU) No 1024/2013 established the Single Supervisory Mechanism for the banking union in the Eurozone.&lt;SEP&gt;This regulation outlines the specific tasks assigned to the European Central Bank regarding the supervision of credit institutions.</data>
