      <data key="d1">category</data>
      <data key="d2">Directive (EU) 2016/97 is legislation laying down rules on insurance distribution within the European Union.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/97 outlines regulations regarding insurance distribution to enhance consumer protection and market integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;Directive (EU) 2016/97 relates to insurance distribution and aims to enhance consumer protections.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-822d11ee35b843c977677acb37cb5e92&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-5feee5d6760dd9294ff28632c1064eee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f916ea8f111ac8a27b80c713b9819522</data>
