      <data key="d1">event</data>
      <data key="d2">OJ L 287 is the official journal where the regulation No 1024/2013 was published, documenting legal acts in the European Union.</data>
      <data key="d3">chunk-db5e21dde5d3a662be4300c54e8c07a9</data>
      <data key="d4">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/158/</data>
