    <edge source="Union Harmonisation Legislation" target="AI System">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems must comply with Union harmonisation legislation, especially concerning substantial modifications that affect compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union Harmonisation Legislation establishes the regulatory framework that governs the use and compliance of AI systems embedded in products.</data>
