    <edge source="Union Harmonisation Legislation" target="AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems are assessed under the Union Harmonisation Legislation to determine their risk level and compliance with safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems must comply with Union harmonisation legislation to ensure they meet established standards and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems qualify under the regulations concerning high-risk products specified in Union harmonisation legislation.</data>
