      <data key="d7">The guidelines developed by the Commission must be consistent with Union Harmonisation Legislation, indicating an interdependence between the two.&lt;SEP&gt;The guidelines must be consistent with Union harmonisation legislation, indicating a strong relationship between adherence to the law and regulatory guidance.</data>
