    <edge source="AI System" target="Regulation">
      <data key="d6">54.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI System is governed by the Regulation, which details the obligations of providers regarding compliance and assessment, particularly in high-risk cases. This Regulation establishes the requirements that AI systems must adhere to in order to be compliant for markets within the Union. It outlines the compliance requirements necessary to ensure that AI systems are used appropriately across multiple sectors, including both military and civilian applications. The classification of the AI System as high-risk is explicitly defined and regulated by this framework, underscoring the legal implications associated with its use. Moreover, the Regulation provides a comprehensive framework that governs the deployment and provision of AI systems by various entities operating within the Union. It mandates that the AI System must adhere to specific regulations that establish a risk-management process aimed at mitigating health and safety risks related to its operation.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI classification,AI governance,compliance,governance,legal framework,market access,regulation compliance,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,risk assessment,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-bb293bcc156cb87ef4a7db6744a38f0d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f950b0056f6fe5d8f4c1fed6ffcce00&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f89272eea67d32d6ca0a58d004c2f75e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3af424118c8f8024a835a3de370430b3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-09f7f5e50e0159a18231b3da95f30cab&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043dd859ed68e9fbb76ff618fe32c054</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/63/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/82/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/86/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/23/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/24/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/65/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428029</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Personal Data">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The use of the AI system involves the processing of personal data, which is heavily regulated under Union law and the Charter.</data>
      <data key="d8">data processing,legal requirements</data>
