      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/134/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426369</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Right to Explanation of Individual Decision-Making">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The right to explanation pertains specifically to decision-making outcomes produced by AI systems, ensuring that affected individuals receive clarity regarding their implications.</data>
      <data key="d8">rights protection,transparency</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-cad430846dc3448ba37c9f18d213e761</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/86/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426403</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Importer">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Importer is involved in placing AI systems on the Union market under a foreign entity's brand.</data>
      <data key="d8">market entry,supply chain</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Distributor">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Distributor makes AI systems available in the Union market, acting as a link between providers and end-users.</data>
      <data key="d8">distribution,market availability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Operator">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Operator manages the deployment and operation of AI systems, ensuring compliance with regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Safety Component">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Safety components are critical parts of AI systems that ensure user health and safety during operation.</data>
      <data key="d8">functionality,safety</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Instructions for Use">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Instructions for use guide users on the intended purpose and proper handling of the AI system.</data>
      <data key="d8">operational standards,user guidance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Recall of an AI System">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A recall refers to actions that may be necessary for an AI system that does not meet safety requirements or functionality.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,product safety</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-63b7f62ee5f6ce97705b963caea85497</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Deployer">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The deployer utilizes the AI system as per the instructions provided by the provider for its intended purpose.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,usage</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-18590180ace1a86abda373a524de5d70</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="reasonably foreseeable misuse">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">There is a connection between AI systems and reasonably foreseeable misuse as the misuse concerns arise when users do not adhere to the intended purpose or instructions.</data>
      <data key="d8">behavioral implications,usage risks</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-18590180ace1a86abda373a524de5d70</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="safety component">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The safety component is integral to ensuring the AI system operates safely and as intended, preventing risks to users.</data>
      <data key="d8">operational integrity,safety measures</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-18590180ace1a86abda373a524de5d70</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="performance of an AI system">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The performance of the AI system is measured against the intended purpose, showing the effectiveness of the AI in application.</data>
      <data key="d8">effectiveness,user assessment</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-18590180ace1a86abda373a524de5d70</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Conformity Assessment">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems undergo conformity assessments to ensure they meet the necessary regulations outlined in union harmonisation legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;The conformity assessment is necessary to determine if an AI system meets the required compliance standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">assessment,compliance verification,regulatory compliance,regulatory process</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f20adf0cd08ecffde7f6a9e3860025d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9cac9d5c84dcacd663b50bbd6c7786</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/128/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426884</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="CE Marking">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">CE marking indicates that an AI system has passed conformity assessments and meets EU requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;CE marking is required to indicate that AI systems conform to EU standards and regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">certification,compliance,standards</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f20adf0cd08ecffde7f6a9e3860025d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Post-Market Monitoring System">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The post-market monitoring system collects data on AI systems to ensure ongoing compliance and identification of risks after market entry.&lt;SEP&gt;The post-market monitoring system is integral to ensuring the continued safety and effectiveness of AI systems following their market entry.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance assurance,monitoring,ongoing evaluation,safety monitoring</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f20adf0cd08ecffde7f6a9e3860025d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Notified Body">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified bodies assess AI systems to verify their compliance with EU regulations, ensuring their market readiness.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance assessment,market readiness</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f20adf0cd08ecffde7f6a9e3860025d5</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Biometric Data">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems can utilize biometric data for identification and processing, highlighting the intersection of technology and personal data.</data>
      <data key="d8">data usage,technology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Harmonised Standard">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Harmonised standards define the technical specifications that AI systems must adhere to for conformity assessment in the EU.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,standardization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Common Specification">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Common specifications provide detailed requirements for AI systems to ensure they meet necessary European regulations and standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulatory requirements,technical specifications</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Training Data">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Training data is essential for AI systems as it allows them to learn and adapt their performance based on the input they receive.</data>
      <data key="d8">data utilization,machine learning</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Validation Data">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Validation data is essential for tuning the performance of AI systems to ensure they operate effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Validation data is used for evaluating AI systems, ensuring they operate accurately and effectively after training.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI training,effectiveness,performance evaluation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-de448579f0f397ec535d8acdb68580bc</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Biometric Identification">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Biometric identification leverages AI systems to automate the recognition of individuals, which enhances security measures and user verification.</data>
      <data key="d8">automation,identification technology</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-92041f4b18683dbe895c82ad1d995a03</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
