    <edge source="AI System" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI system is regulated by the Commission to ensure compliance with EU standards and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for establishing classifications for AI systems, including those that are high-risk and not high-risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the regulatory framework governing the compliance of AI systems with European laws and standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,oversight,regulation,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight,risk classification</data>
