      <data key="d11">1748428020</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Providers">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers are responsible for the identification and mitigation of risks associated with the AI system's operation and foreseeable misuse.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers supply the AI System and are responsible for ensuring that the systems are accompanied by appropriate documentation and instructions.</data>
      <data key="d8">responsibility,risk mitigation,supply chain</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6adccf24f1ddc4835908b879bcbe8674&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-043dd859ed68e9fbb76ff618fe32c054</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/72/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/65/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428101</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Risk-Management System">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI system operates under a risk-management system designed to address specific risks associated with its use and deployment.</data>
      <data key="d8">risk assessment,safety</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-043dd859ed68e9fbb76ff618fe32c054</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/65/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428029</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Member State">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are responsible for ensuring that AI system documentation and instructions for use are clear and meet the needs of target deployers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Member State is responsible for the withdrawal of the AI system from the market if non-compliance is justified.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,market compliance,regulatory action,regulatory responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-85726b1098cb96ad81df40234ad5da52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6adccf24f1ddc4835908b879bcbe8674</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/72/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/81/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428504</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Documentation">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Documentation is essential for the AI system as it provides information on intended and precluded uses, enhancing user understanding.</data>
      <data key="d8">information accessibility,user guidance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6adccf24f1ddc4835908b879bcbe8674</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/72/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428101</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI System" target="Annex III">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
