    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Regulation">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems must comply with the legal requirements set forth in regulations to be safely integrated into final products.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation governs the standards and practices for developing high-risk AI systems to mitigate potential risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulation provides a framework for the safe use of high-risk AI systems to protect health and fundamental rights.</data>
