      <data key="d11">1748428032</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="New Legislative Framework">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The New Legislative Framework governs the operational context of High-Risk AI Systems to ensure they meet essential product safety requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Legislative Framework sets out broader conditions that encompass high-risk AI systems within its compliance structure.</data>
