    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Market Surveillance Authority">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Market Surveillance Authority is responsible for authorizing high-risk AI systems following compliance checks.&lt;SEP&gt;The market surveillance authority is tasked with overseeing the compliance of high-risk AI systems with regulatory obligations.</data>
