      <data key="d11">1748425998</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Provider">
      <data key="d6">69.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Provider is tasked with defining essential measures and guidelines to ensure the safe and compliant usage of High-Risk AI Systems. They bear direct accountability for the actions associated with these systems, particularly concerning their introduction into the market. The Provider is responsible for ensuring compliance with all relevant standards and regulations prior to the deployment of High-Risk AI Systems. Additionally, they must oversee adherence to regulations regarding serious incidents related to these systems. It is also the Provider's duty to evaluate whether changes made to the AI system necessitate a new conformity assessment in accordance with regulatory requirements. Overall, the Provider is responsible for the development and supply of High-Risk AI Systems, ensuring that these systems satisfy specific safety and regulatory compliance criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider of a high-risk AI system is responsible for ensuring that instructions for use consider potential risks and mitigations associated with the system.</data>
      <data key="d8">accountability,compliance,compliance determination,compliance responsibility,development responsibility,product development,regulatory compliance,responsibility,risk mitigation,safety standards,supply,system accountability</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b453ab3d6dba9c33ee17222e5c44491b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4ed64bdb2c36cf3a65859258e7888a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d1c74c72b39d6d10e4a07d1cd427ae52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba1dc3004941b91546fa83dccd4be34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-858c2a77ba4972f9c4e3f47479bfef07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6a9cac9d5c84dcacd663b50bbd6c7786&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58f0e847b8539a8464411c02db611351&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cacea1a9e8134dea64495d76d382dcc</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/128/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/73/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/13/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/79/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/27/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/24/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/65/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428029</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Deployer">
      <data key="d6">51.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Deployer is tasked with the implementation and oversight of high-risk AI systems, ensuring that their operation aligns with the provider's guidelines and legal standards. This role encompasses the management and reporting of the operational deployment of these systems, including any incidents that may arise during their use. The Deployer is responsible for the ongoing service of high-risk AI systems and must adhere to the obligations outlined in relevant regulations. Compliance with these obligations is crucial to mitigate risks and prevent misuse of the high-risk AI systems. Overall, the Deployer plays a vital role in the decision-making process that relies on the effective and responsible use of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,implementation responsibilities,implementation responsibility,legal framework,operational oversight,operational responsibility,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,service obligations,technology deployment,usage</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-f9ecbbe19a0b82c0cc27910d673dea46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-9ba1dc3004941b91546fa83dccd4be34&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-858c2a77ba4972f9c4e3f47479bfef07&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58f0e847b8539a8464411c02db611351&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02b30ca877df5f1c4eaed18ba9fb4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cad430846dc3448ba37c9f18d213e761</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/86/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/73/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/84/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/27/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/25/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/65/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428032</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Human Oversight Measures">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Human Oversight Measures are essential for ensuring the safe deployment and functioning of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Human oversight measures are designed to help interpret the outputs from high-risk AI systems correctly, ensuring safety and reliability.</data>
      <data key="d8">accurate interpretation,regulatory compliance,safety measures,safety protocols</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4ed64bdb2c36cf3a65859258e7888a51&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-58f0e847b8539a8464411c02db611351</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/27/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/13/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426251</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Fundamental Rights Impact Assessment">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Conducting a Fundamental Rights Impact Assessment is required for the deployment of high-risk AI systems to minimize risks to human rights.</data>
