    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="EU Declaration of Conformity">
      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems must be documented with an EU Declaration of Conformity to legally operate within the EU framework.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Declaration of Conformity is a key document that certifies the compliance of high-risk AI systems with legal standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU Declaration of Conformity is specifically required for High-Risk AI Systems to demonstrate their compliance with EU legislation.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI safety,compliance certification,documentation,legal requirement,regulatory compliance,regulatory documentation</data>
