    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Regulation (EU) 2017/745">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2017/745 includes provisions that categorize certain AI systems, particularly when they integrate with medical devices, under high-risk requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2017/745 influences the regulatory landscape that also applies to certain High-Risk AI Systems as safety components.</data>
