    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Distributor">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Distributors must ensure that high-risk AI systems comply with regulatory standards before being made available on the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributors must meet specific obligations pertaining to high-risk AI systems, especially if they alter or label these systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The distributor must ensure that the high-risk AI system it sells conforms to safety requirements, or take corrective action if it does not.&lt;SEP&gt;Distributors of high-risk AI systems must follow regulations set forth for providers, ensuring they meet compliance obligations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,distribution role,obligations,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,safety oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d1c74c72b39d6d10e4a07d1cd427ae52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ecbbe19a0b82c0cc27910d673dea46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02b30ca877df5f1c4eaed18ba9fb4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cacea1a9e8134dea64495d76d382dcc</data>
