      <data key="d11">1748427609</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI System" target="Importer">
      <data key="d6">34.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Importers must assume responsibilities regarding high-risk AI systems, particularly when they put their name on them or modify them.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers must ensure high-risk AI systems comply with EU regulations before introducing them into the market.&lt;SEP&gt;The importer must adhere to regulations for high-risk AI systems, ensuring they do not pose risks upon introduction to the market.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers of high-risk AI systems are also subject to the regulations established for providers of such systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,market access,market introduction,market requirements,obligations,regulatory compliance,regulatory obligations</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d1c74c72b39d6d10e4a07d1cd427ae52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f9ecbbe19a0b82c0cc27910d673dea46&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c02b30ca877df5f1c4eaed18ba9fb4d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cacea1a9e8134dea64495d76d382dcc</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/84/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/24/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/25/</data>
