    <edge source="New Legislative Framework" target="Union">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The New Legislative Framework is an initiative by the Union to improve consistency in product legislation across member states, ensuring products are safe and compliant.&lt;SEP&gt;The New Legislative Framework operates under the Union's regulatory mechanisms, guiding the conformity assessment processes for products.</data>
