    <edge source="Regulation" target="Union">
      <data key="d6">26.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Union creates the Regulation to establish guidelines that govern the cooperation of competent authorities at various levels.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union enacts the Regulation to provide a coherent framework for AI systems across its member states.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union establishes regulations that govern the operation of AI regulatory sandboxes across Member States.</data>
      <data key="d8">governance,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6741d9dacc504660a09282cfdfdfe32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a33f9372e32e8879cc6f97cd662934d5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dc0938655f22b840224fc49f2018dbf1</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/58/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/21/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/167/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428475</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="AI Systems Providers">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Systems Providers must comply with the Regulation to ensure they operate fairly within the Union.</data>
