      <data key="d11">1748426426</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="Notified Bodies">
      <data key="d6">43.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies must adhere to regulations concerning subcontracting and qualifications for their subsidiaries.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified Bodies operate under specific regulations set by the Commission to ensure compliance with the Union Act.&lt;SEP&gt;The operations of notified bodies are governed by specific regulations that mandate their independence and impartiality during assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified Bodies operate under the guidelines established in the Regulation which delineates their responsibilities and processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulation establishes the requirements that notified bodies must comply with for third-party conformity assessments.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance standards,governance,legal framework,operational framework,regulatory framework,regulatory guidelines,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-fc730bebf215fc150b211b590e39bd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b4903f69522ce55807b4320731843ac&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-219cf6d8c7b4aad1f5b0ef20e76dd301&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b26d81b437e55548d31af147fd90ef23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-647c11490314deffe2ceff0b84c7700c</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/31/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/35/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/33/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/34/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/126/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427340</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation" target="Union Act">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulations are developed based on the provisions of various Union Acts to guide the activities of Notified Bodies.</data>
