    <edge source="European Union" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Union establishes regulations and standards for the assessment and conformity of high-risk AI systems to ensure safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union establishes regulations that govern the compliance requirements for high-risk AI systems within its jurisdictions.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union has specific regulations regarding high-risk AI systems, especially in sensitive domains like law enforcement and migration.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Union's regulations include specific guidelines for the deployment of high-risk AI systems to safeguard workers' rights and fundamental freedoms.</data>
