    <edge source="European Union" target="Regulation (EU) 2016/679">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Union enforces Regulation (EU) 2016/679 as part of its legal framework on data protection and privacy issues.&lt;SEP&gt;The GDPR is part of the EU's legal framework for protecting personal data rights across member states.</data>
