      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are involved with enforcement against widespread infringement, as it affects collective legal standards and individual rights.&lt;SEP&gt;Widespread infringement impacts the collective interests of individuals across multiple Member States, indicating a legal issue affecting many regions.</data>
