    <edge source="Member State" target="Notified Bodies">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified bodies must be established under the national law of a Member State, ensuring they operate within legal frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies operate under the authority and regulations established by the Member State that oversees their conformity assessment activities.</data>
