      <data key="d6">37.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"National competent authorities are required to notify the market surveillance authority of serious incidents per the regulations."\&lt;SEP&gt;Market Surveillance Authority is another designation within the National Competent Authorities focusing on market monitoring and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Market Surveillance Authority works in conjunction with National Competent Authorities to address notifications regarding serious incidents.&lt;SEP&gt;Market surveillance authorities facilitate the access of national competent authorities to documentation related to high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Market Surveillance Authorities are capable of performing tasks allocated to National Competent Authorities as per national needs.</data>
