    <edge source="Market Surveillance Authority" target="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d6">46.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Market Surveillance Authorities operate under the guidelines established by Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 when handling complaints.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 outlines the role and functioning of the market surveillance authority in relation to high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The market surveillance authority ensures compliance with the provisions outlined in Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 provides the legal framework within which the Market Surveillance Authority operates to ensure compliance in the market.&lt;SEP&gt;The Market Surveillance Authority operates under the guidelines established by Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 to oversee AI systems presenting risks.</data>
