      <data key="d9">chunk-3e6126c3c3690a61de0436f93b2741fd</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/163/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426104</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Union" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">66.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission acts within the Union to oversee and implement regulations regarding codes of practice for content management.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates under the framework of the Union, primarily tasked with proposing and implementing legislation across various sectors, including artificial intelligence (AI). It fulfills critical transparency obligations that impact all member states, ensuring that operations align with Union law and promote coordination among relevant authorities. The Commission also explores international instruments aimed at enhancing trade agreements and is responsible for establishing and enforcing regulations across multiple areas, with a particular focus on AI. Furthermore, the Union delegates supervisory and enforcement powers regarding AI model obligations to the Commission, reinforcing its role as a regulatory body within the governance structure of the Union.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission operates within the framework of the Union to develop expertise in AI and manage related initiatives.</data>
      <data key="d8">9,collaboration,executive function,governance,legal authority,policy implementation,regulation compliance,regulatory authority,regulatory body,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,trade agreements</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ede6b0da3acfca47d4e90d51eb5fc4df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dee723ad2204a364a1d2dbe158b59a8f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-032b6d55e2d7c256240e44f70df0e5d7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-abc588d012f1bc89cd1e08c6d43bb27a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69eb093d5893337024ffe62fdcc78563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-294b469b584f56e6e7fcf1b55e7e0df7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7fb8d7d117faa045c40802649821c422&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa0ab303aa0764433ae306cd3e410cb</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/162/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/127/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/135/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/66/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/149/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/46/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/50/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/64/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428154</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Union" target="Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Competent Authorities are established within the Union framework to oversee law enforcement and judicial cooperation.</data>
