    <edge source="Union" target="AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">24.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Union establishes safety requirements and compliance guidelines for products that include high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union is involved in legislating and harmonizing safety standards for AI systems to ensure compliance in the market.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union regulates the development and implementation of AI systems to ensure compliance with data protection laws.</data>
