    <edge source="Union" target="European Data Protection Supervisor">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Data Protection Supervisor operates within the framework of the Union to enforce data protection regulations and impose fines for non-compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Data Protection Supervisor operates within the framework of the Union, ensuring compliance with data protection regulations applicable to its institutions.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory enforcement</data>
