    <edge source="Union" target="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI regulatory sandbox operates under the legal framework and directives established by the Union for AI development and testing.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union sets the legislative framework within which AI regulatory sandboxes operate, promoting cross-border cooperation.</data>
