    </edge>
    <edge source="Union" target="national competent authorities">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">National competent authorities cooperate with the Union to ensure consistency in safeguarding practices.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union collaborates with national competent authorities to ensure consistent practices across member states regarding fundamental rights and safety.</data>
