    <edge source="Union" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-risk AI systems are regulated under the Union's legislation for compliance and assessment, thus creating a direct link between the two.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union creates provisions for the management and regulation of high-risk AI systems to ensure safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union regulates high-risk AI systems to ensure safety and compliance within its market, establishing strict requirements for providers.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union sets the regulations and legal framework governing the testing and deployment of high-risk AI systems in Europe.</data>
