    <edge source="Union" target="Natural Persons">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Natural Persons are exempt from certain Union regulations when using AI systems for personal activities, highlighting a distinction in legal obligations.&lt;SEP&gt;Natural persons are protected under the regulations established by the Union, ensuring they are judged fairly and based on actual behavior.&lt;SEP&gt;The Union implements regulations to protect the rights and privacy of Natural Persons within its jurisdiction.</data>
