    <edge source="Member States" target="Commission">
      <data key="d6">205.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are required to notify the Commission of rules on penalties and enforcement measures, indicating a hierarchical enforcement structure.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are required to report to the Commission about the administrative fines issued annually.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States report to the Commission about administrative fines and related litigation annually.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission and Member States engage in a collaborative partnership to oversee and implement regulations pertaining to various areas, particularly in relation to high-risk artificial intelligence (AI) systems, biometric identification systems, and data protection within the European Union (EU). 

Member States have a duty to notify the Commission about their national laws regarding the use of biometric identification systems, ensuring that the Commission is informed about the identities of their respective authorities. This information-sharing is essential for effective oversight as outlined by relevant regulations. The relationship is characterized by a shared commitment to enforcing regulations, with the Commission issuing directives that Member States are required to adhere to, particularly concerning the assessment and management of AI systems, as stated under Regulation (EU) No 182/2011.

The Commission actively collaborates with Member States to implement regulations, maintain compliance standards, and facilitate the development of voluntary codes of conduct aimed at enhancing AI literacy among stakeholders. Moreover, the Commission and Member States work together to evaluate and reduce compliance costs notably for small and medium-sized enterprises (SMEs) and start-ups, supporting innovation while upholding regulatory standards. 

The Commission also plays a critical role in gathering and publishing data concerning biometric identification systems utilized for law enforcement purposes, which further exemplifies their collaborative efforts in data sharing and regulatory oversight. Additionally, they ensure that Member States are notified of changes in the regulatory landscape, including updates on the status of conformity assessment bodies and rules regarding penalties, thereby fostering a holistic regulatory environment.

In summary, the partnership between the Commission and Member States is integral to achieving compliance, effective governance, and high standards within the EU, particularly in areas concerning AI systems and biometric identification, bolstered by a framework of communication and cooperation. Their coordinated initiatives are essential for regulatory enforcement and the promotion of advancements in AI literacy.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States coordinate with the Commission to facilitate the AI Office's tasks and objectives.</data>
      <data key="d8">8,EU governance,collaboration,communication,compliance,compliance oversight,consultation,control,governance,information sharing,legal framework,notification,oversight,regulatory authority,regulatory communication,regulatory compliance,regulatory cooperation,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight,regulatory support,reporting</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7386be7bd3bdbe2e4df94de9c70d8784&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-7127c7bb3049241e70ac955f8f0024b5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bbb1781c5c0edcb30e49953ca1852eb0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2c2b5e8ac0ca306f10d2418b0493cf1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756d4785a21d555261254273b91aea54&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c8c050fb13af07ed12982fe6bfe7abf4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93c0980cd75cdf016ff776144a4a70db&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698242b390a097d688dcef4fc03d6687&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b6884d6c4641c256f66289e2e2b56965&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f15020eb940c70ceebc99b92dce7bdc7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-893f47aa930b4d23e13586827fdcfea9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d7c3502c744cfa90a7690ed32f3264&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2b7923bde8b2532e6e5a248aa4cfb8a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fafe6ac227379dad776c22a5abc16ea4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-69eb093d5893337024ffe62fdcc78563&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c88552f4423ec18db9bfb3db0f708349&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-cefadab290f58f81c115a49845f866d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ede6b0da3acfca47d4e90d51eb5fc4df&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f567c4be37bce779f921de15ad5f2a7f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-553e3df123166674b26c5dc07f2a83af&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-c638834e00b09677a065c6dc80878fa7&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1a9e7815086e5c37a3beb2705ee18d8e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b5f2c129e84e53724de4a8e9f61091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-aed721d84482f8eb2ef2f8c288d59095</data>
