    <edge source="Member States" target="Council">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States provide feedback to the Council regarding the application of EU regulations, impacting its legislative processes.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council comprises representatives from Member States, underscoring the connection between national governments and EU decisions.</data>
      <data key="d8">EU decision-making,government representation,legislative influence,member feedback</data>
