      <data key="d11">1748427628</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Member States" target="European Commission">
      <data key="d6">40.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are required to notify the European Commission about the regulations and rules they adopt regarding biometric identification systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission engages with Member States when objections are raised against authorizations issued for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission facilitates access to experts for the Member States, ensuring compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission works with Member States to ensure compliance with EU law regarding certificates and safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission works with Member States to ensure compliance with regulations regarding notified bodies and conformity assessments.</data>
      <data key="d8">administrative support,collaboration,compliance,legal compliance,notification,regulatory collaboration,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-fc730bebf215fc150b211b590e39bd0b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2207c69786b5e6add33d2fe8c768a341&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-909533e383afbbc7e4815cf0fcaee662&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-17b23a5bf3ea6e9c99542abdf17cfaa8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1d7350246beee832b58d5c53fa874095</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/5/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/46/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/126/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/69/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/36/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427772</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Member States" target="Enforcement Activities">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are responsible for conducting enforcement activities to ensure adherence to regulations.</data>
