    <edge source="Member States" target="Third Countries">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States engage with Third Countries through cooperation agreements to enhance law enforcement efforts.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States engage with Third Countries to share knowledge and best practices regarding AI regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">international cooperation,law enforcement,regulatory sharing</data>
