    <edge source="Member States" target="Judicial Cooperation">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are required to cooperate in judicial matters as outlined in EU regulations, facilitating cross-border legal proceedings.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States engage in Judicial Cooperation as part of their obligations and commitments within the Union.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,legal framework,mutual assistance,obligations</data>
