      <data key="d7">Member States are tasked with developing initiatives that specifically support SMEs, including providing information and regulatory access.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States must consider the interests of SMEs while defining penalties, highlighting a focus on economic viability in regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are tasked with providing support and facilitating access to AI regulatory sandboxes for SMEs.</data>
