    <edge source="Member States" target="Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Competent Authorities operate under the direction of Member States to implement national AI regulatory sandboxes effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States designate Competent Authorities to oversee the establishment and functioning of AI regulatory sandboxes across their jurisdictions.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent Authorities support Member States in developing the organizational expertise needed for AI regulation compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States designate competent authorities responsible for overseeing the authorized use of biometric identification systems in accordance with national law.</data>
