      <data key="d11">1748427772</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Member States" target="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Member States are mandated to establish AI regulatory sandboxes within their jurisdictions to comply with European Union regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Member States are responsible for establishing AI regulatory sandboxes to promote safe and innovative development of AI systems.</data>
