    <edge source="AI Systems" target="Conformity Assessment">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Conformity assessments are necessary for AI systems to verify their compliance with regulations and standards.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems need to undergo a conformity assessment to establish their trustworthiness before being placed on the market.</data>
