      <data key="d7">Providers develop and supply AI systems classified as high-risk, requiring compliance with the Union's safety regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers of High-Risk AI Systems manufacture and supply AI systems that fall under the high-risk category, making them subject to specific regulations.</data>
