      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems used by law enforcement must operate within the guidelines of Directive (EU) 2016/680 to protect individual rights.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems used in law enforcement contexts must comply with Directive (EU) 2016/680, which sets rules for personal data protection.</data>
