      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI systems are utilized to evaluate credit scores, determining individuals' access to financial resources and services.&lt;SEP&gt;AI systems are utilized to evaluate credit scores, impacting individuals' access to necessary financial resources.</data>
