      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/175/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426009</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="European Parliament" target="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689">
      <data key="d6">79.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Parliament is involved in the legislative process for adopting Regulation (EU) 2024/1689.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament is responsible for adopting Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, impacting the legislation concerning AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament plays a pivotal role in the development, adoption, and implementation of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which pertains to artificial intelligence (AI) systems. This regulation aims to establish harmonised rules for AI systems, ensuring safety components and addressing broader regulatory responsibilities concerning AI legislation within the European Union. Through its involvement, the European Parliament not only oversees but actively contributes to shaping the regulatory framework that governs AI practices, thus impacting the legal landscape for AI technologies in the EU.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Parliament plays a role in the creation and adoption of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, influencing AI governance in the EU.</data>
      <data key="d8">EU governance,governance,institutional role,legislation,legislative authority,legislative process,policy making,regulation adoption,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9e684e7a7455e5a2acc2023aa30291f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0325a6544b6b69856a2fcf978648cb23&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2633a0fb5f0222ac492dc16170f8b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3accdffb1c2e32b663cc603e80d7c590&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204417a83231993542d757c6207e53bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00b19e3b24207a0c4ca2dafab289e7bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-99768c8a9d9e625e95c97ba673449e27&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79114aa8214caf01a991b9fd731ca2f1</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/103/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/108/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/106/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/107/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/110/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/105/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/102/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428587</data>
    </edge>
