    <edge source="Union Law" target="High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">43.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems are governed by Union Law, which sets out the deployment and oversight obligations for such technologies.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are regulated under Union Law to ensure protection of health, safety, and fundamental rights.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are specifically governed by provisions outlined in Union Law to ensure safety and compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems must comply with the standards and requirements set forth by Union law regarding risk management processes.&lt;SEP&gt;Union law governs the application of rights concerning high-risk AI systems and outlines exceptions or restrictions applicable to them.</data>
