    <edge source="Commission" target="Advisory Forum">
      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The Advisory Forum advises the Commission, ensuring that multiple stakeholders are considered in the development of standards and regulations.")&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum collaborates with the Commission to ensure comprehensive stakeholder representation in regulation implementation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum may also prepare written contributions at the request of the Commission.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum supports the Commission by advising on regulatory matters related to AI.</data>
