      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Annex XIII is a foundational document that the Commission uses to determine criteria for classifying systemic risks in AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission uses Annex XIII to specify and update criteria for assessing systemic risks of AI models.</data>
