    <edge source="Commission" target="Article 90(1)">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 90(1) empowers the Commission to designate AI models as presenting systemic risks and mandates actions based on alerts from scientific panels.&lt;SEP&gt;The authority of the Commission to designate systemic risks is outlined in Article 90(1) of the regulatory framework.</data>
