    <edge source="Commission" target="general-purpose AI model">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is responsible for assessing the systemic risks of general-purpose AI models and may take action based on their evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for designating general-purpose AI models as having systemic risks based on defined criteria.</data>
