    <edge source="Commission" target="scientific panel">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is informed by assessments from the scientific panel, which alerts it to potential systemic risks in AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The scientific panel can request the Commission to mandate documentation from AI providers to fulfill their oversight role.</data>
