    <edge source="Commission" target="systemic risk">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is responsible for designating whether an AI model presents systemic risks based on assessments and criteria.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's role involves evaluating whether general-purpose AI models present systemic risks, forming critical oversight function.</data>
      <data key="d8">oversight,regulation,regulatory oversight,risk determination</data>
