    <edge source="Commission" target="Standing Subgroup for Market Surveillance">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission supports the activities of the Standing Subgroup in undertaking market evaluations and coordinating among authorities.</data>
      <data key="d8">coordination,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-294b469b584f56e6e7fcf1b55e7e0df7</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/149/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426184</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Market Evaluations or Studies">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission conducts Market Evaluations or Studies to identify aspects of regulations requiring urgent coordination among surveillance authorities.</data>
      <data key="d8">evaluation,regulatory compliance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-294b469b584f56e6e7fcf1b55e7e0df7</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/149/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426184</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">56.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission plays a pivotal role in supervising and coordinating the activities of National Competent Authorities, ensuring they adhere to established regulations and standards concerning high-risk AI systems. It is responsible for overseeing these authorities, which must notify the Commission of any serious incidents related to such systems as stipulated by the regulation. Additionally, the Commission facilitates the exchange of experiences and resources among National Competent Authorities, promoting collaboration in the enforcement of AI regulations. This includes coordinating efforts to establish AI regulatory sandboxes, where compliance with AI frameworks can be ensured. Through these actions, the Commission fosters a collaborative environment that enhances the effectiveness of national regulatory efforts in the field of artificial intelligence.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission works in tandem with National Competent Authorities to ensure the implementation of AI regulations and compliance checks.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,compliance,governance,incident reporting,oversight,regulation,regulatory compliance,regulatory coordination,regulatory enforcement,regulatory governance,resource support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de9b8f7d9312e3a2994cf6e1b14f1f9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea6f686eb4c40a3f9d758b4efcf3418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6fe20aa0cce0b31f6a43c755317350d6&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-24b5f2c129e84e53724de4a8e9f61091&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-977670aa5941763001334246314af150&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32123438327e3ea3ecbf471a4c04236d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855a53cf044206d9081c530a357042fe</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/6/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/70/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/73/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/115/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/57/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428151</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Conformity Assessment Bodies">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission encourages the establishment of Conformity Assessment Bodies to meet regulatory requirements under EU law.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,regulatory development</data>
