    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Article 98(2)">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission follows the procedures outlined in Article 98(2) when making implementing acts regarding notified bodies.&lt;SEP&gt;The examination procedure referred to in Article 98(2) outlines how the Commission can adopt implementing acts.</data>
