    <edge source="Commission" target="Regulation (EU) 2019/1020">
      <data key="d6">36.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is responsible for enforcing and overseeing compliance with Regulation (EU) 2019/1020.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for overseeing the implementation of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 and other related regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for the implementation and oversight of Regulation (EU) 2019/1020, which governs market surveillance practices in relation to AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for enforcing the stipulations laid out in Regulation (EU) 2019/1020 regarding AI technologies.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,enforcement,oversight,regulatory enforcement,regulatory framework,regulatory governance,regulatory oversight</data>
