    <edge source="Commission" target="Scientific Panel">
      <data key="d6">35.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission issues requests for information to AI model providers based on substantiated requests from the scientific panel.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scientific Panel is established by and operates under the guidelines set forth by the Commission concerning AI regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission relies on the Scientific Panel to inform it about AI models that may need classification as having systemic risk.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scientific Panel provides alerts and evaluations to the Commission, aiding in decisions about AI models' classifications and risks.</data>
      <data key="d8">advisory role,collaboration,establishment,regulation oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory framework,risk assessment</data>
