    <edge source="Commission" target="EU Database">
      <data key="d6">33.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission is responsible for overseeing the EU Database and its access controls as per the regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the establishment and operation of the EU database, ensuring it complies with regulations and cybersecurity standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees the management of the EU database, which collects data related to compliance and incidents of AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The EU database is referenced by the Commission for managing regulatory information and compliance."|"information management, regulatory oversight</data>
