    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="SMEs">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">SMEs may provide simplified technical documentation as per guidelines established by the Commission to ensure compliance with high-risk AI system requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's guidelines particularly consider the needs of SMEs, indicating a focus on supporting smaller businesses in the context of AI regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulatory compliance,regulatory focus,simplified documentation,support for businesses</data>
