    <edge source="Commission" target="State of the Art on AI">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission's guidelines take into account the state of the art on AI to align regulatory measures with current technological advancements.</data>
      <data key="d8">regulatory alignment,technological consideration</data>
