      <data key="d11">1748426801</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Market Surveillance Authorities">
      <data key="d6">50.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission and Market Surveillance Authorities work closely together to promote compliance with regulations and standards, particularly concerning AI systems. Market Surveillance Authorities coordinate with the Commission on various actions and investigations, proposing joint activities to address compliance issues effectively. They also report their findings and any compliance issues to the Commission, which helps link their activities to the enforcement of EU legislation. Additionally, the Commission collaborates with these authorities to ensure that databases adhere to market regulatory standards and guidelines, reinforcing the overall framework for compliance and oversight in the market.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,compliance action,cooperation,enforcement,oversight,regulatory collaboration,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-cefadab290f58f81c115a49845f866d1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70fac425f08c058417791cd1d66faab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-dda722630e3447daa9258a423b2cbedd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-64d7c3502c744cfa90a7690ed32f3264&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-756bc5b856a1d06a78ffd0aeb1d318b4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-094ac0cdb13f3aae73279288ea0dd3f8</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/160/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/66/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/79/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/71/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/74/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427973</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers of general-purpose AI models must report serious incidents to the Commission for oversight and regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for overseeing the regulations applicable to General-Purpose AI Models.".</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance oversight,oversight,regulation,regulatory authority</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de9b8f7d9312e3a2994cf6e1b14f1f9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa0ab303aa0764433ae306cd3e410cb</data>
