      <data key="d11">1748427210</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Complaints">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission establishes the framework in which Complaints can be lodged regarding general-purpose AI models usage.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance reporting,regulatory framework</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4fa0ab303aa0764433ae306cd3e410cb</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/162/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426913</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Council">
      <data key="d6">39.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission collaborates with the Council to assess the need for binding measures or actions on AI development and standardization.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission submits evaluations and reports to the Council as part of its regulatory framework."&lt;/|"regulatory reporting, oversight&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is required to consult the Council before adopting delegated acts, indicating a formal communication and collaboration.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council receives notifications from the Commission about proposed legislative acts and has the authority to object to those acts within a specified timeframe.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission collaborates with the Council to ensure that laws and directives, including those related to AI systems, are aligned with the interests of member states.</data>
      <data key="d8">8,collaboration,consultation,cooperation,governance,governance collaboration,government oversight,legislative authority,policy making</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-95e4a754288e197556a2ac28696f415d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-eef924ac2e26af24531952fcd79e9d21&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a79b7078e45aa680595b27c1baab1b2e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-912c6c18744e587fbf617952631e25a8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ac1055eaf28da7935aee66a1acf9705b</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/112/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/74/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/97/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428543</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Commission" target="Binding Measures or Actions">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission evaluates and proposes binding measures or actions to ensure compliance of AI systems with regulations.</data>
