      <data key="d7">The Commission collaborates with Regulatory Authorities to ensure compliance and effective information exchange under international agreements."| "regulatory cooperation, international law&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission oversees regulatory authorities to ensure their compliance with EU directives and maintain standards within member states.</data>
