      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies must communicate with the Commission regarding compliance and the status of certificates during periods of suspension.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies must inform the Commission and other relevant authorities about their compliance status and any changes in designation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission investigates notified bodies to ensure they meet the necessary requirements for operation.</data>
