      <data key="d7">"The Commission regulates High-Risk AI Systems through established standards to ensure their safe deployment in the market.")&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission develops guidelines to ensure that the quality management requirements for high-risk AI systems are appropriately defined for microenterprises.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission establishes the regulatory framework that governs the assessment and validation of High-Risk AI Systems to ensure safety and compliance.</data>
