      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission develops guidelines specifically tailored for microenterprises in regards to quality management systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission is responsible for creating guidelines that allow microenterprises to meet quality management system obligations in a simplified way.</data>
