    <edge source="Commission" target="AI Literacy">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission aims to advance AI literacy as part of its mandate to promote responsible AI development and usage.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission's role includes ensuring the wide implementation of AI literacy measures to enable informed decision-making in AI systems.</data>
