      <data key="d7">The Commission receives annual reports from Member States related to the use of biometric identification systems for law enforcement, based on established templates.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission utilizes the Annual Reports to inform its regulatory tasks and to evaluate the effectiveness of the AI sandboxes.</data>
