    <edge source="Commission" target="Official Journal of the European Union">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission needs to ensure that relevant harmonised standards are published in the Official Journal for them to be recognized and enforced.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission publishes regulations and decisions in the Official Journal of the European Union to ensure they are accessible to all stakeholders.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,official publication,publication,regulatory transparency</data>
