    <edge source="Testing and Experimentation Facilities" target="AI Regulatory Sandboxes">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI Regulatory Sandboxes often collaborate with Testing and Experimentation Facilities to effectively conduct trials and evaluations of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Testing and experimentation facilities operate within AI regulatory sandboxes to test AI systems under real-world conditions.</data>
