    <edge source="Advisory Forum" target="Board">
      <data key="d6">30.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Advisory Forum is tasked with preparing opinions and recommendations at the request of the Board.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum provides technical advice to the Board, assisting it in its regulatory tasks.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum provides technical expertise and advice to the Board related to regulatory matters.&lt;SEP&gt;The Board may invite the Advisory Forum to provide insights during its deliberations and meetings.</data>
      <data key="d8">advisory role,consultation,expertise,governance,institutional relationship,report preparation,stakeholder involvement</data>
