    </edge>
    <edge source="Advisory Forum" target="Stakeholders">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Stakeholders have an interest in the advisory forum's discussions and may participate in its meetings to voice their concerns.&lt;SEP&gt;The Advisory Forum is established to ensure the involvement of various stakeholders in regulatory processes.</data>
      <data key="d8">participation,regulatory involvement,stakeholder engagement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-42d0cbfdb0213c7d2eb8c1b2d49876e8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-47ac4d6cae0afd3292516531be7716e9</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/67/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/150/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428455</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Advisory Forum" target="Small and Medium Enterprises (SMEs)">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Advisory Forum aims to ensure representation from SMEs to balance commercial interests in regulatory discussions.</data>
      <data key="d8">business representation,stakeholder diversity</data>
