    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="Technical Expertise">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board receives technical expertise from the Advisory Forum to assist in regulation-related decisions.</data>
      <data key="d8">advisory role,technical support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-42d0cbfdb0213c7d2eb8c1b2d49876e8</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/150/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748425983</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="AI Office">
      <data key="d6">47.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office and the Board work collaboratively to ensure the effective development, evaluation, and monitoring of AI codes of practice. The AI Office plays a crucial role in informing the Board of any alerts and measures taken regarding AI risks, thereby facilitating informed decision-making. Additionally, the AI Office is responsible for submitting annual reports to the Board, which allows for oversight and assessment of AI sandbox implementation. To support the Board's operations, the AI Office provides administrative assistance, including scheduling meetings, preparing agendas, and offering secretarial services to organize its meetings. Through this collaboration, both entities contribute to the governance and oversight of AI practices.</data>
      <data key="d8">administrative support,collaboration,communication of risks,governance,organization,organizational collaboration,organizational support,regulatory oversight,reporting structure</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea6f686eb4c40a3f9d758b4efcf3418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65cbc432dadad605b2e47a18258f70a0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3da283c72662f2af740c6edac711fbbe&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1dadce264ce0bde619c89498814a8a8</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/65/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/57/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/90/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427823</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="Standing Subgroup for Market Surveillance">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board may establish the Standing Subgroup to examine specific market issues and coordinate actions.</data>
      <data key="d8">governance,organization</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-294b469b584f56e6e7fcf1b55e7e0df7</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/149/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426184</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="AI Models Providers">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board collaborates with AI Models Providers to understand their input in the codes of practice.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,stakeholder involvement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board interacts with National Competent Authorities to monitor the implementation of AI regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,regulatory monitoring</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="The Commission">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board is responsible for receiving information about fines imposed by the Commission, ensuring oversight of regulatory actions.</data>
      <data key="d8">communication,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5923815c3c9119488dbfaacede6dec0c</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/101/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426481</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Board" target="European Commission">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Board is involved in the communication of information regarding the fines imposed by the European Commission, indicating oversight responsibilities.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Commission consults the Board to gain insights and ensure comprehensive stakeholder engagement during the standardisation process.</data>
      <data key="d8">communication,consultation,governance,regulatory oversight</data>
