      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/79/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426007</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="Recital 79">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Recital 79 establishes the framework for the provider's accountability regarding high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">legal framework,responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-b453ab3d6dba9c33ee17222e5c44491b</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/79/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426007</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers are responsible for developing general-purpose AI models, which must be classified based on their predefined criteria and risks.&lt;SEP&gt;The provider is responsible for developing general-purpose AI models and ensuring they comply with regulatory standards, including notification of risks.</data>
      <data key="d8">development,development responsibility,regulatory compliance,responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-656f81fa0b40b7a24d1c380c887e5b9a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8db527e2cb5184f356edf18fd10c9f36</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/112/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/52/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426552</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="Deployers">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Deployers are required to inform providers about any risks related to the deployment of AI systems, establishing a communication chain for safety.</data>
      <data key="d8">communication,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-0b7a97b6144d96bce021cd4b80f21b84</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/26/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426283</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="Distributor">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Distributors must verify that providers have fulfilled their obligations regarding the release of high-risk AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers supply AI systems to distributors, who then handle the distribution to deployers while ensuring compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The distributor must inform the provider of any non-compliance issues with the high-risk AI system.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,information sharing,provider responsibility,supply chain</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-d1c74c72b39d6d10e4a07d1cd427ae52&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2cacea1a9e8134dea64495d76d382dcc&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7a97b6144d96bce021cd4b80f21b84</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/24/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/26/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427151</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="Serious Incident">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Provider is responsible for reporting serious incidents that relate to their high-risk AI system offerings.</data>
      <data key="d8">incident reporting,responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9ba1dc3004941b91546fa83dccd4be34</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/73/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426389</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">National Competent Authorities oversee the Provider's compliance with incident reporting outlined in the regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,regulatory oversight</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9ba1dc3004941b91546fa83dccd4be34</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/73/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426389</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="EU Database">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Provider must register their high-risk AI systems in the EU Database, as per the regulations outlined.".</data>
      <data key="d8">registration requirement,regulatory compliance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6024a6811c3d1fa27f1ad4e415829f3d</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/49/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426477</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Provider" target="Authorised Representative">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Authorised Representative is designated by the Provider to manage the registration process in the EU Database.".&lt;SEP&gt;The authorised representative acts on behalf of the provider to fulfill regulatory obligations regarding AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">delegated authority,regulatory compliance,representation</data>
