      <data key="d11">1748426223</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Risk Management System">
      <data key="d6">20.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Risk Management System is designed specifically to address and manage the risks associated with High-Risk AI Systems during their lifecycle.&lt;SEP&gt;The Risk Management System is designed specifically to mitigate risks associated with the deployment of high-risk AI systems.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,risk assessment,system management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4f95db6a695983806a19cc3c8894b56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2567ed4486ee359c31fd399ca77e5a3</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/17/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/9/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427498</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Post-Market Monitoring System">
      <data key="d6">42.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A Post-Market Monitoring System is essential for managing the risks associated with High-Risk AI Systems after deployment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Post-Market Monitoring System ensures ongoing compliance and performance evaluation after AI systems are launched.&lt;SEP&gt;The post-market monitoring system is designed specifically to evaluate high-risk AI systems and ensure they meet legal requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Post-Market Monitoring System's purpose is to continuously evaluate and monitor High-Risk AI Systems for compliance with safety standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The Post-Market Monitoring System facilitates ongoing scrutiny of High-Risk AI Systems to ascertain they uphold required performance and safety beyond their initial market release.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,ongoing compliance,ongoing evaluation,performance monitoring,regulatory framework,risk assessment,risk management,safety assurance,systems evaluation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-4f95db6a695983806a19cc3c8894b56a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1fbb87b8107271f1fe959942ad2e3666&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e2567ed4486ee359c31fd399ca77e5a3&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-474278e863b3ff46a7c4578eb30850a5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-078bfdf1b899d975b7606b4acd63166d</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/72/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/17/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/81/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/155/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/9/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428497</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Reporting Procedures">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
