    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Article 79(1)">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 79(1) addresses the requirements for deployers of High-Risk AI Systems, indicating their obligations to inform authorities about risks.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are governed by Article 79(1), which sets forth rules regarding the risks they may present.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance obligations,regulation,risk management</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-88ec674dfb566598c9f54b13ca64a3c4&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0b7a97b6144d96bce021cd4b80f21b84</data>
