    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Law Enforcement Authorities">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Law enforcement authorities are required to document their use of high-risk AI systems, ensuring compliance with data protection regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement authorities utilize high-risk AI systems for operational efficiency while adhering to data protection laws.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement authorities utilize high-risk AI systems to conduct risk assessments related to criminal activities and investigations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,investigative processes,law enforcement,operational efficiency,technology implementation,technology use</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-2c2b5e8ac0ca306f10d2418b0493cf1f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-42a8b91e450f13e8f10679d8814fac73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32ccfe5fb33f83ead7b5c0eb2f0576d9</data>
