      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">High-Risk AI Systems can lead to Serious Incidents, which necessitate close monitoring and regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;Serious incidents are specifically related to high-risk AI systems that must be reported as part of regulatory compliance.</data>
