    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Annex III">
      <data key="d6">45.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Annex III details specific AI systems classified as high-risk based on their functionality and impact.&lt;SEP&gt;Annex III outlines the identification criteria for high-risk AI systems that require conformity assessment procedures.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems are defined within Annex III, which sets the conditions for registration.".&lt;SEP&gt;The classification of high-risk AI systems is defined in Annex III, which specifies the conditions for their assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;High-risk AI systems are defined and regulated under the requirements established in Annex III.</data>
