    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Feedback Loops">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Feedback Loops can pose risks to High-Risk AI Systems if not properly managed to avoid bias in future operations.&lt;SEP&gt;Feedback loops in high-risk AI systems can potentially introduce biases, necessitating strict mitigation measures.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI behavior,bias risk,operational integrity,risk management</data>
