    <edge source="High-Risk AI Systems" target="Data Poisoning">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Data poisoning is a significant risk considered when assessing the cybersecurity of high-risk AI systems under current regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Data poisoning is a significant threat to high-risk AI systems, impacting the quality of training data.&lt;SEP&gt;High-Risk AI Systems must be protected against Data Poisoning to ensure that their training data remains valid and reliable.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance risk,cyber threat,data integrity,risk factor,security threat,training integrity</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-72f817acfaca14a17a21a75176f408a9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f59c6f62bd0ab2d5521810dcbca8373d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3615b104e6e36e2c3fca2765ce18eace</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/15/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/77/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428260</data>
