      <data key="d11">1748425998</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="Market Surveillance Authorities">
      <data key="d6">68.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office collaborates closely with Market Surveillance Authorities to ensure compliance evaluations and investigations concerning high-risk AI systems. This collaboration involves joint efforts in conducting compliance evaluations and supports regulatory cooperation between the two entities. Market Surveillance Authorities engage with the AI Office for assistance in high-risk system investigations, addressing complaints, and monitoring outcomes related to AI technologies.

The AI Office plays a vital role in supporting Market Surveillance Authorities by supplying crucial information that aids in the verification of compliance for high-risk AI models. Additionally, the AI Office provides coordination support, enhancing the efficiency of investigations into potential systemic risks associated with these AI systems. Together, the AI Office and Market Surveillance Authorities work towards maintaining compliance standards and monitoring potential risks within the AI landscape.</data>
      <data key="d8">8,9,compliance,compliance assurance,compliance efforts,cooperation,information sharing,investigation support,investigative collaboration,monitoring,oversight,regulatory compliance,regulatory support,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-933ead385d4e52b665df0118cb006cfd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-b5d5f6eeef12730fe7e1d6c295c7eaa5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-a273f410d091773f8f78908d89074682&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-094ac0cdb13f3aae73279288ea0dd3f8&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-1c8209179d5378dd2b308defab64f33b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4fa0ab303aa0764433ae306cd3e410cb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0873f73c77d97fdb97b3523748b32638</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/160/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/162/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/75/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/68/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/161/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/74/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427884</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="Union Level">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office operates at the Union Level, facilitating supervision and compliance of AI systems according to EU regulations.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,regulatory authority</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-a273f410d091773f8f78908d89074682</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/161/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426044</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="scientific panel">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The scientific panel supports the monitoring activities of the AI Office, collaborating to ensure safety in AI model governance.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,governance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3e6126c3c3690a61de0436f93b2741fd</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/163/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426104</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="general-purpose AI models">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office monitors general-purpose AI models to detect and address potential risks associated with their use.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office sets terms for tools and services, distinguishing their treatment from general-purpose AI models provided under open licenses.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,contract terms,differentiation,risk monitoring</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3e6126c3c3690a61de0436f93b2741fd&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3150ae4fb871ce38df11dd1f2932123b</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/25/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/163/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427609</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="general-purpose AI model">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office engages with providers of general-purpose AI models for access requests and evaluations.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office monitors general-purpose AI models to detect and address potential risks associated with their use.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI model assessment,compliance,evaluation process,risk monitoring</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-46b1355e6b7cbd10c4515c00ce75a0b0&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3e6126c3c3690a61de0436f93b2741fd</data>
