    <edge source="AI Office" target="Civil Society Organisations">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Civil Society Organisations may provide support and input to the AI Office during the formation of codes of practice.&lt;SEP&gt;Civil Society Organisations support the AI Office in the process of drawing up the codes of practice, representing diverse stakeholder interests.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office is expected to consult with Civil Society Organisations to incorporate diverse viewpoints in the development of codes of practice.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office seeks input from civil society organisations to better understand the impacts of AI on various groups.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,consultation,ethical oversight,public interest,stakeholder engagement,stakeholder involvement,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-831c946b1acae90a683cbc5ac489ffaf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2bf6ae679199f6853488d22af6ebdf75&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/116/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/95/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428577</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="Key Performance Indicators">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office aims to include Key Performance Indicators in the codes of practice to measure the success of objectives.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office uses Key Performance Indicators to assess the implementation and outcomes of the codes of practice.</data>
      <data key="d8">accountability,evaluation metrics,implementation,performance measurement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="AI Models Providers">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office invites AI Models Providers to participate in the development of codes of practice.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,regulatory engagement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="National Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">47.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office and National Competent Authorities work collaboratively to promote the effective operation of AI regulatory sandboxes. National Competent Authorities are responsible for coordinating activities with the AI Office, informing it about the establishment of these sandboxes, and seeking its support and guidance. The AI Office plays a crucial role in ensuring that the codes of practice adhere to national regulations and assists National Competent Authorities in maintaining compliance with AI regulations at the national level. Through this partnership, the AI Office and National Competent Authorities aim to effectively exercise their regulatory responsibilities and uphold regulatory compliance for AI models.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,compliance,cooperation,coordination,regulatory alignment,regulatory framework,regulatory oversight,support</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-8f93754b5b045f375c5040d0de011e4b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-46a2185c0e7d022c2e0146a9f59929c2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698790297e0868d1f8befe15f8307380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855a53cf044206d9081c530a357042fe</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/57/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/101/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/53/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428629</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="Downstream Providers">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office ensures that Downstream Providers adhere to the commitments outlined in the codes of practice.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,stakeholder engagement</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ce2d90ba5ad6c09478b10ca441d65c59</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="Commitments or Measures">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office ensures that the codes of practice include Commitments or Measures for all participants.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,obligations</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="2 May 2025">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office has set a deadline of 2 May 2025 for the completion of the codes of practice, emphasizing a timeline for accountability.</data>
      <data key="d8">deadline,project timeline</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="2 August 2025">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">If the codes of practice cannot be finalized by 2 August 2025, the AI Office may assess and propose further actions.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office must finalize the codes of practice by 2 August 2025 to ensure compliance and implementation.</data>
      <data key="d8">accountability,deadline assessment,finalization deadline,regulatory review</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-e6477d7c505ff9323e02b84771a5cb45&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-ec36ff3483a4dfeb40db5ce54ff19937</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/56/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426363</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="AI Office" target="codes of practice">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Office encourages AI model providers to adhere to codes of practice, ensuring compliance with standards.</data>
