      <data key="d6">34.0</data>
      <data key="d7">"The AI Office monitors the compliance of providers of general-purpose AI models with copyright laws and their obligations."&lt;&lt;SEP&gt;Providers must comply with requests from the AI Office and cooperate to demonstrate compliance with regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers must supply necessary documentation to the AI Office to ensure regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Office evaluates providers' compliance with established codes of practice and harmonised standards.</data>
