    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="Directive (EU) 2016/680">
      <data key="d6">36.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both Regulation (EU) 2016/679 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 establish frameworks for the protection of personal data in different contexts, contributing to overall data security.&lt;SEP&gt;Both regulations are part of the EU's legal framework governing data protection, addressing different aspects of personal data handling.&lt;SEP&gt;Both regulations focus on the protection of personal data but address different aspects: general data protection and specific law enforcement protocols.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2016/679 and Directive (EU) 2016/680 complement each other in providing a robust data protection framework across different contexts.</data>
      <data key="d8">data protection,legal framework,legislative framework,regulations,regulatory complementarity</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6e35e35e2f589e83baa732e4cdf12f1b&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-70fac425f08c058417791cd1d66faab2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-32ccfe5fb33f83ead7b5c0eb2f0576d9&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-65688cdd97448f1f3932957595156d18</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/74/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/10/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/140/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/26/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428412</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="AI regulatory sandboxes">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The activities within AI regulatory sandboxes are governed by Regulation (EU) 2016/679, which ensures the protection of data subjects' rights during experimentation.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI regulation,data protection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-5e7a419de4926f1a525df3f4ac669396</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/59/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426294</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="special categories of personal data">
      <data key="d6">5.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2016/679 includes provisions regarding the processing of special categories of personal data."|</data>
      <data key="d8">5</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3a3264abf04a576ae16d704acaaf3687</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/3/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="personal data">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2016/679 defines and provides protections for personal data within the EU legislative framework.</data>
