      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/95/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427049</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="Regulation (EU) 2016/680">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both regulations establish requirements for processing personal and biometric data, with Regulation (EU) 2016/680 specifically addressing law enforcement contexts.</data>
