    </edge>
    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="Directive 95/46/EC">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The GDPR replaced Directive 95/46/EC, incorporating its principles into a more comprehensive framework for data protection.</data>
