    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2016/679" target="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The AI Regulatory Sandbox allows for the development of AI systems while adhering to the principles established in Regulation (EU) 2016/679 concerning data protection.</data>
