    <edge source="Directive (EU) 2016/680" target="Regulations (EU) 2016/679">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2016/679's guidelines have influenced the provisions established in Directive (EU) 2016/680 for data protection in law enforcement contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;These regulatory instruments work together to provide a comprehensive approach to data protection and privacy, especially in the context of law enforcement.</data>
      <data key="d8">data protection,influence,legal compliance,legal framework</data>
