    </edge>
    <edge source="Directive (EU) 2016/680" target="Regulations (EU) 2018/1725">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Both regulations focus on safeguarding personal data processed by different entities, emphasizing the importance of privacy across various contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Both regulations share the goal of ensuring the protection of personal data processed by EU institutions and law enforcement agencies respectively.</data>
      <data key="d8">data privacy,data processing,privacy,shared objectives</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-7b27dc39e557245814845f393e9bb76f&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-d9acb869e8831be994323dab5f07993e</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/10/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/70/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427784</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Directive (EU) 2016/680" target="Deployers of High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The directive provides a legal framework that deployers must follow when using AI systems for law enforcement purposes.</data>
