    <edge source="Directive (EU) 2016/680" target="Article 10">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 10 outlines conditions under which biometric data processing is permitted, defining strict necessity and safeguards outlined in Directive (EU) 2016/680.</data>
