    </edge>
    <edge source="Directive (EU) 2016/680" target="Article 4 (1)">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 4 (1) provides principles for processing biometric data that must be adhered to, supporting the overall framework of Directive (EU) 2016/680.</data>
