    <edge source="Directive (EU) 2016/680" target="Regulation (EU) 2018/1725">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2018/1725 pertains to data protection within the EU institutions, while Directive (EU) 2016/680 focuses on data protection in law enforcement, together ensuring comprehensive coverage.</data>
