    <edge source="data protection impact assessment" target="fundamental rights impact assessment">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The fundamental rights impact assessment is a type of assessment that complements the data protection impact assessment by focusing on individual rights.</data>
      <data key="d8">evaluation process,rights protection</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8a409c89b3b9a2d182dbd568b48e2e16</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/27/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748425998</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="fundamental rights impact assessment" target="law enforcement authority">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Law enforcement authorities are required to conduct a fundamental rights impact assessment before deploying biometric systems, ensuring the protection of individual rights.</data>
      <data key="d8">legal obligation,rights protection</data>
