    </edge>
    <edge source="fundamental rights impact assessment" target="law enforcement">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Before deploying a biometric identification system for law enforcement, a fundamental rights impact assessment must be conducted to evaluate implications on individual rights.</data>
      <data key="d8">legal responsibilities,rights protections</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-079fbdf24f8b746547b54a3e43daaf33</data>
