    </edge>
    <edge source="SMEs" target="Providers of General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers of general-purpose AI models will take into account the size of their organization, particularly SMEs, when determining compliance strategies.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance considerations,size impact</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-3f3abbad4dddf2a8a56efeaa03cc7f28</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/109/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426426</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="SMEs" target="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">SMEs are encouraged to participate in the AI Regulatory Sandbox to test their innovative AI systems and access the Union market.&lt;SEP&gt;SMEs participate in the AI regulatory sandbox to test and develop AI technologies under regulatory guidance.</data>
      <data key="d8">innovation encouragement,innovation participation,market access,small business</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-698790297e0868d1f8befe15f8307380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-6741d9dacc504660a09282cfdfdfe32d</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/57/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/58/</data>
