    </edge>
    <edge source="SMEs" target="Conformity Assessment Fees">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">SMEs are directly impacted by Conformity Assessment Fees as these fees affect their overall compliance costs and operations.&lt;SEP&gt;SMEs benefit from reduced conformity assessment fees which are proportional to their size, making compliance more affordable.</data>
