      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">National Competent Authorities should have expertise in AI Technologies to fulfill their regulatory tasks effectively.&lt;SEP&gt;National competent authorities must possess expertise in AI technologies to adequately fulfill their regulatory tasks under the Regulation.</data>
