    <edge source="National Competent Authorities" target="AI Regulatory Sandbox">
      <data key="d6">62.0</data>
      <data key="d7">National competent authorities oversee the implementation of AI regulatory sandboxes to ensure compliance with established regulatory frameworks.&lt;SEP&gt;The AI Regulatory Sandbox is a framework established to facilitate experimentation and innovation in artificial intelligence while ensuring compliance with applicable regulations. National Competent Authorities play a critical role in this ecosystem by implementing and overseeing the operation of the AI regulatory sandbox at the national level. Their responsibilities include authorizing and regulating AI testing to ensure that all applicants comply with necessary standards and practices.

These authorities report on the progress and effectiveness of the AI Regulatory Sandbox, ensuring that it supports innovation while also prioritizing safety and regulatory enforcement. In summary, National Competent Authorities are integral to the establishment, monitoring, and successful operation of the AI Regulatory Sandbox, striking a balance between fostering AI advancements and maintaining regulatory oversight.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,experiment,implementation oversight,innovation support,oversight,oversight role,regulation,regulatory authority,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,regulatory reporting,testing approval</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-6741d9dacc504660a09282cfdfdfe32d&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0055dea9f51c003c924a93b2d83c057c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2ea6f686eb4c40a3f9d758b4efcf3418&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-f1bd36f2082e6f670210d08c02e3d502&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-698790297e0868d1f8befe15f8307380&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-855a53cf044206d9081c530a357042fe</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/57/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/58/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/138/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428381</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="National Competent Authorities" target="Independence">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
