    </edge>
    <edge source="Fundamental Rights" target="Deployers of High-Risk AI Systems">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Deployers must prioritize the protection of fundamental rights when deploying high-risk AI systems in various contexts.&lt;SEP&gt;Deployers of high-risk AI systems are tasked with protecting fundamental rights and conducting assessments to identify risks to those rights.</data>
