    <edge source="Conformity Assessment" target="Notified Bodies">
      <data key="d6">37.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies conduct conformity assessments to evaluate compliance with regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are tasked with performing conformity assessments as per the established regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies perform conformity assessments to certify that products meet necessary legal standards and requirements as stipulated by laws and regulations.&lt;SEP&gt;The conformity assessment of high-risk AI systems is conducted by Notified Bodies, which ensures that these systems meet safety standards.</data>
      <data key="d8">certification,compliance,evaluation,evaluation responsibility,regulatory function,safety certification</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ba752b306c578e6ee0a31563b30db893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3477a6053ebda4f7122ba6adc497a9ee&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-647c11490314deffe2ceff0b84c7700c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-fbacc8a39fa85eaf6afc731174af8109</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/33/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/31/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/45/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/125/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428554</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Conformity Assessment" target="Substantial Modification">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Substantial modification requires a new conformity assessment to evaluate continued compliance of an AI system.</data>
