    <edge source="AI Regulatory Sandbox" target="Competent Authorities">
      <data key="d6">32.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Competent Authorities are responsible for setting up and managing AI regulatory sandboxes to ensure compliance with established requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent authorities are involved in overseeing the AI regulatory sandbox which facilitates the testing of AI systems in a controlled environment.&lt;SEP&gt;Competent authorities oversee and provide guidance within the AI regulatory sandbox to ensure successful testing and development of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers in the AI Regulatory Sandbox must cooperate with Competent Authorities to ensure compliance and mitigate risks during development.</data>
