    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Artificial Intelligence Act">
      <data key="d6">64.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 is part of the legislative efforts encapsulated in the Artificial Intelligence Act.&lt;SEP&gt;The Artificial Intelligence Act is a significant legislative framework in the European Union aimed at regulating artificial intelligence systems. A crucial component of this Act is Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, which establishes the regulatory framework specifically for AI systems. This regulation is integral to the broader objectives of the Artificial Intelligence Act, focusing on setting rules that ensure the safety and governance of AI technologies. Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 serves as the legal backbone for the rules governing artificial intelligence, reinforcing the commitment to create a safe and well-regulated environment for AI system deployment across the EU. Overall, Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 embodies the foundational principles outlined in the Artificial Intelligence Act, emphasizing the importance of a structured legislative approach to AI regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI governance,AI legislation,AI safety,legal categorization,legislation,regulation,regulatory framework,regulatory standards</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-9e684e7a7455e5a2acc2023aa30291f5&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-2f2633a0fb5f0222ac492dc16170f8b1&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-3accdffb1c2e32b663cc603e80d7c590&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-204417a83231993542d757c6207e53bf&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bed819423b33e0b2ff5ff94cc09d52e2&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-00b19e3b24207a0c4ca2dafab289e7bb&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-79114aa8214caf01a991b9fd731ca2f1</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/103/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/108/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/104/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/107/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/110/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/105/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/102/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428587</data>
    </edge>
