    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Regulation (EU) No 167/2013">
      <data key="d6">24.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 amends Regulation (EU) No 167/2013, specifically concerning artificial intelligence systems as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;The regulation on AI modifies Regulation (EU) No 167/2013, showcasing the evolving regulations in agricultural technology.&lt;SEP&gt;The requirements in Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 may impact the agricultural sector by addressing AI applications under Regulation (EU) No 167/2013.</data>
