      <data key="d6">32.0</data>
      <data key="d7">AI technologies must comply with the standards set in Regulation (EU) No 168/2013 as specified by Regulation (EU) 2024/1689.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 alters existing regulations including Regulation (EU) No 168/2013, indicating a cross-sectoral influence of AI.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 amends Regulation (EU) No 168/2013 by introducing new considerations for AI systems as safety components.&lt;SEP&gt;Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 amends Regulation (EU) No 168/2013 to include specific considerations on artificial intelligence systems as safety components.</data>
