    <edge source="Regulation (EU) 2024/1689" target="Council of the European Union">
      <data key="d6">63.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Council of the European Union collaborates with the European Parliament in the process of approving Regulation (EU) 2024/1689.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council of the European Union plays a significant role in the legislative process surrounding AI regulations, specifically through its deliberations and adoption of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689. In collaboration with the European Parliament, the Council contributes to the formulation and approval of this regulation, which impacts AI systems and influences broader AI policy decisions. The Council engages in discussions and agreements on the proposals outlined in Regulation (EU) 2024/1689, emphasizing its collaborative efforts with the European Parliament to ensure the successful passage of this important legislation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Council of the European Union collaborates with the European Parliament on the adoption of Regulation (EU) 2024/1689 regarding AI standards.</data>
