    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Models" target="Cybersecurity Protection">
      <data key="d6">27.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Cybersecurity protection measures are essential for general-purpose AI models to ensure their integrity and prevent system failures.&lt;SEP&gt;Ensuring cybersecurity protection is crucial for managing the risks associated with deploying general-purpose AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers are required to implement cybersecurity protection measures for general-purpose AI models to mitigate systemic risks.</data>
      <data key="d8">protective measures,risk mitigation,safety measures,systemic risks</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-de9b8f7d9312e3a2994cf6e1b14f1f9e&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-bfd9734e617f6b77f1d098f074a31788</data>
