    <edge source="General-Purpose AI Models" target="Codes of Practice">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Codes of Practice outline the obligations that providers of General-Purpose AI Models must adhere to in order to mitigate potential systemic risks.&lt;SEP&gt;Codes of practice directly pertain to the compliance requirements of general-purpose AI models, guiding providers in meeting obligations.</data>
      <data key="d8">AI standards,compliance,compliance guidelines,regulation</data>
