    <edge source="Systemic Risks" target="General-Purpose AI Model">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">General-Purpose AI Models may present systemic risks due to their high-impact capabilities that could affect the internal market and broader systems.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models can present systemic risks that must be evaluated and monitored by authorities as per the regulatory framework.&lt;SEP&gt;General-purpose AI models may present systemic risks that require careful classification and oversight from regulatory bodies.</data>
