    </edge>
    <edge source="Systemic Risks" target="Self-replicating Models">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Self-replicating models pose unique systemic risks as their capacity to duplicate can lead to uncontrolled proliferation.</data>
