    </edge>
    <edge source="The Commission" target="Court of Justice of the European Union">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission's decisions regarding fines can be reviewed by the Court of Justice of the European Union!&lt;SEP&gt;The Court of Justice reviews the decisions made by the Commission regarding the imposition of fines on providers, ensuring legal compliance.</data>
      <data key="d8">enforcement,legal authority,legal oversight,regulatory oversight</data>
