    </edge>
    <edge source="The Commission" target="Annex IV">
      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission has the authority to amend Annex IV to ensure it reflects technical progress and compliance requirements.&lt;SEP&gt;The Commission has the power to amend regulations outlined in Annex IV regarding conformity assessments.</data>
