      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/165/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427139</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="The Commission" target="Post-Market Monitoring Plan">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The Commission has the authority to adopt a standardized post-market monitoring plan that providers must follow for compliance.</data>
