    </edge>
    <edge source="Scientific Panel" target="Article 90">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 90 establishes the procedures for the Scientific Panel to alert regarding systemic risks in AI models.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scientific Panel's tasks include advising on the classifications of AI models as outlined in Article 90.</data>
      <data key="d8">advice,alert procedures,regulatory compliance,risk management</data>
