    <edge source="Scientific Panel" target="Independent Experts">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Independent Experts serve on the Scientific Panel to offer insights and fulfill the objectives of the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The Scientific Panel is constituted of Independent Experts who provide oversight and recommendations for the Regulation.</data>
