      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/recital/54/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748427448</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Sectoral Group of Notified Bodies">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies participate in the Sectoral Group to collaborate on knowledge sharing and best practices for conformity assessment.</data>
      <data key="d8">collaboration,knowledge exchange</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-27e18f1e7a64d4e39363cecdd238a532</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/38/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426107</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Notifying Authority">
      <data key="d6">45.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies must inform the Notifying Authority about their use of subcontractors or subsidiaries in conformity assessments.&lt;SEP&gt;Notifying Authorities are responsible for notifying organizations to become Notified Bodies for the purpose of conformity assessment.&lt;SEP&gt;The Notifying Authority requires notified bodies to keep relevant documents regarding subcontractors for a specified period.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are required to inform the notifying authority about key activities and decisions regarding conformity assessments and approvals.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority requires ongoing updates from notified bodies regarding assessments and quality management actions in accordance with the law.</data>
      <data key="d8">certification,designation,oversight,record keeping,regulatory communication,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight,regulatory responsibility</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ba752b306c578e6ee0a31563b30db893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-647c11490314deffe2ceff0b84c7700c&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-27e18f1e7a64d4e39363cecdd238a532</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/33/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/45/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/38/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428112</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Union Act">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies are designated under specific Union Acts that outline their responsibilities and functions in conformity assessment.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,regulatory designation</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-0b4903f69522ce55807b4320731843ac</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/35/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426431</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Conformity Assessment Procedure">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies play a critical role in the conformity assessment procedure, approving high-risk AI systems for market entry.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies are responsible for carrying out conformity assessments on high-risk AI systems according to regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">assessment,certification,compliance body,quality assurance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-8d1e54ed74d0a58b519fd1bbf3dc8f50&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-0842049245a4a646a8a2e3b5c4cb5fbc</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/43/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426498</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Subsidiaries">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies can subcontract tasks to their subsidiaries and are responsible for their actions.</data>
      <data key="d8">organizational hierarchy,subcontracting</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-647c11490314deffe2ceff0b84c7700c</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/33/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426562</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Subcontractors">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies hire subcontractors to perform tasks related to conformity assessments and are responsible for their actions.</data>
      <data key="d8">organizational responsibility,subcontracting</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-647c11490314deffe2ceff0b84c7700c</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/33/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426562</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Conformity Assessment Activities">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Conformity assessment activities are the primary functions carried out by notified bodies to certify compliance with standards.&lt;SEP&gt;The activities performed by notified bodies include assessing high-risk AI systems to ensure their operational compliance and integrity.&lt;SEP&gt;Notified bodies conduct conformity assessment activities as part of their responsibilities in evaluating product compliance.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,compliance certification,core function,evaluation,operational integrity,quality assurance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-ba752b306c578e6ee0a31563b30db893&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-93bf0556246eea991173613a2ccf1b73&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-219cf6d8c7b4aad1f5b0ef20e76dd301</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/31/&lt;SEP&gt;https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/45/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748428112</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Cybersecurity Requirements">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified bodies must satisfy specific cybersecurity requirements to protect sensitive information during their assessment activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">assessment integrity,security</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-219cf6d8c7b4aad1f5b0ef20e76dd301</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/31/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426852</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Quality Management">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The operations of notified bodies must include quality management practices to ensure effective assessment processes.</data>
      <data key="d8">operational integrity,quality assurance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-219cf6d8c7b4aad1f5b0ef20e76dd301</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/31/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426852</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Independence">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The independence of notified bodies is crucial to their role, ensuring their assessments are unbiased and credible.</data>
      <data key="d8">impartiality,quality assurance</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-219cf6d8c7b4aad1f5b0ef20e76dd301</data>
      <data key="d10">https://artificialintelligenceact.eu/article/31/</data>
      <data key="d11">1748426852</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Consultancy Services">
      <data key="d6">9.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified bodies must avoid providing consultancy services to ensure their assessments remain impartial and free from conflict of interest.</data>
