      <data key="d11">1748426852</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Confidentiality">
      <data key="d6">19.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified bodies have a legal obligation to maintain confidentiality during conformity assessment as part of their operational guidelines.&lt;SEP&gt;The role of notified bodies includes maintaining confidentiality of information in accordance with regulatory requirements.</data>
      <data key="d8">confidentiality,information security,regulatory compliance</data>
