    <edge source="Notified Bodies" target="Providers">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified Bodies assess the compliance of Providers' high-risk AI systems to ensure they meet required safety and regulatory standards.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers must work with notified bodies to ensure their high-risk AI systems comply with relevant regulations prior to deployment.</data>
