      <data key="d6">16.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Notified bodies operate under the guidelines set forth in Annex VII when issuing certificates for AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The operations and assessments of notified bodies are guided by the requirements set forth in Annex VII.</data>
