    <edge source="Notifying Authority" target="Conformity Assessment Body">
      <data key="d6">28.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The conformity assessment body must submit applications for notification to the notifying authority in the Member State where it is established.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority designates conformity assessment bodies for conducting assessments on AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The notifying authority oversees the process by which conformity assessment bodies are designated and monitored.</data>
      <data key="d8">application process,compliance,designation,regulatory compliance,regulatory oversight</data>
