    <edge source="Technical Documentation" target="Importers">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Importers are required to maintain Technical Documentation to demonstrate the compliance of high-risk AI systems for a specific duration after market placement.&lt;SEP&gt;Importers are required to verify that the Technical Documentation is available and meets regulatory standards before market placement.</data>
