    </edge>
    <edge source="Technical Documentation" target="Providers of General-Purpose AI Models">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Providers must create and maintain technical documentation for their AI models as part of regulatory compliance.&lt;SEP&gt;Providers must prepare and keep updated technical documentation as mandated by regulations to demonstrate compliance.</data>
