      <data key="d11">1748426175</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="EU Declaration of Conformity" target="Notified Body">
      <data key="d6">10.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A Notified Body is responsible for issuing the EU Declaration of Conformity, confirming that high-risk AI systems meet the necessary standards prior to entry to the market.</data>
