    <edge source="European Data Protection Supervisor" target="Union Institutions">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">The European Data Protection Supervisor can create a sandbox that applies to Union Institutions for regulatory oversight of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The European Data Protection Supervisor oversees Union Institutions and has the authority to impose administrative fines for data protection infringements.</data>
      <data key="d8">compliance,organizational oversight,regulation,regulatory oversight</data>
