    <edge source="Article 73" target="National Market Surveillance Authority">
      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 73 outlines procedures for reporting serious incidents, ensuring accountability during the testing of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 73 requires reporting of serious incidents to the national market surveillance authority, highlighting their role in oversight.</data>
      <data key="d8">accountability,incident reporting,oversight</data>
