    <edge source="provider" target="authorised representative">
      <data key="d6">25.0</data>
      <data key="d7">An authorised representative acts on behalf of a provider to meet regulatory obligations regarding AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;The authorised representative acts on behalf of the provider to ensure compliance with the Regulation.&lt;SEP&gt;The authorised representative acts on behalf of the provider to handle compliance issues with the AI Office.</data>
