      <data key="d6">17.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Training data sets are necessary for creating effective validation data sets that check the performance of AI systems.&lt;SEP&gt;Validation data sets follow training data sets to assess the accuracy of AI models, making them crucial for ensuring model reliability.</data>
