    </edge>
    <edge source="personal data" target="profiling">
      <data key="d6">14.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Profiling often involves the processing of personal data to assess individual characteristics, which is subject to regulatory oversight by the AI Office.&lt;SEP&gt;Profiling often utilizes personal data to create models that predict behaviors or attributes of individuals.</data>
