    </edge>
    <edge source="law enforcement authority" target="publicly accessible space">
      <data key="d6">15.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Law enforcement authorities may monitor publicly accessible spaces using systems like remote biometric identification for security purposes.&lt;SEP&gt;Law enforcement authorities often oversee activities within publicly accessible spaces to ensure security and compliance with regulations."|</data>
