      <data key="d11">1748426654</data>
    </edge>
    <edge source="deployer" target="Making Available on the Market">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">A deployer plays a role in making an AI system available on the market under their authority, thereby ensuring compliance with market regulations.</data>
