    </edge>
    <edge source="Publicly Accessible Space" target="Public Roads and Squares">
      <data key="d6">7.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Examples like public roads and squares demonstrate what qualifies as publicly accessible spaces according to the Regulation.</data>
      <data key="d8">examples,public environment</data>
