    </edge>
    <edge source="Publicly Accessible Space" target="Publicly Accessible Spaces Exclusions">
      <data key="d6">8.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Certain spaces are explicitly excluded from being classified as publicly accessible, providing contrast to publicly accessible spaces.</data>
