    <edge source="Article 75" target="National Market Surveillance Authority">
      <data key="d6">18.0</data>
      <data key="d7">Article 75 empowers the national market surveillance authority to conduct inspections and checks during the testing process.&lt;SEP&gt;Article 75 provides the legal framework that empowers the National Market Surveillance Authority to monitor and regulate testing activities.</data>
      <data key="d8">authority,compliance,legal framework,regulatory authority</data>
      <data key="d9">chunk-17d875a9ff2b02237bb4b9ba04e5b92a&lt;SEP&gt;chunk-4a7fb5abd6ad1ba2e9256fc63dbda4a7</data>
